
# game/a1s4.rpy:4
translate latin a1s4_6afd289b:

    # "Over the next week or so, I start to get used to my new life."
    "Per proximam hebdomadem aut circiter novae vitae meae assuescere incipio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:5
translate latin a1s4_8894246b:

    # "I find that the days are easy to adjust to, and like Alex said, 19 hours in a day isn't all that bad."
    "Diebus facile assuescere possum; ut Alex dixit, dies 19 horarum non tam malus est."

# game/a1s4.rpy:6
translate latin a1s4_9ae1e3e1:

    # "Though the sleeping period is a bit shorter than I'm used to, it's been easier now that I sleep on Amicus's bed."
    "Quamquam tempus somni paulo brevius est quam solebam, iam facilius est, quia in lecto Amici dormio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:7
translate latin a1s4_6eb5f483:

    # "After I'd fallen asleep next to him, we decided that there was enough room."
    "Postquam iuxta eum obdormiveram, decrevimus satis loci esse."

# game/a1s4.rpy:8
translate latin a1s4_2b7c8f9f:

    # "The wolf set one of his many long pillows down between us as a courtesy to me, even if he did sometimes end up rolling over onto my end."
    "Lupus unum ex multis longis pulvinis suis inter nos posuit, ut verecundiae meae consuleret, quamquam interdum se volvens in meam partem lecti veniebat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:10
translate latin a1s4_c998480b:

    # "He's been busy these past few days, and I think it's because of what happened between him and Cato."
    "His diebus proximis occupatus fuit, et credo id propter ea esse quae inter eum et Catonem acciderunt."

# game/a1s4.rpy:11
translate latin a1s4_dff09ea7:

    # "He doesn't suggest any more \"outings\" and instead wakes up early to go to meditation before leaving for the city to do various campaigning stuff."
    "Nullas alias \"excursiones\" proponit; potius mane mature surgit ut meditetur, deinde in urbem abit ut varia opera ad petitionem imperii pertinentia agat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:12
translate latin a1s4_2f11c6bf:

    # "Amicus doesn't explain exactly what that involves, and he doesn't bring me along."
    "Amicus non exacte explicat quid ea opera complectantur, neque me secum ducit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:13
translate latin a1s4_da6cd6a8:

    # "I ask why, considering I thought my main job was to accompany him to these things, but he just says he's not doing the stuff that involves me quite yet."
    "Quaero cur, quoniam principale officium meum eum ad haec comitari putabam; sed tantum dicit se nondum ea agere quae me complectantur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:14
translate latin a1s4_83d52ae6:

    # "Instead, my introduction to the people of Adastra is going to be during the first trial."
    "Potius populo Adastrae in primo certamine ostendar."

# game/a1s4.rpy:15
translate latin a1s4_3d602cee:

    # "He says the reveal will be a lot more impressive that way, and that rumors are already spreading about his new pet."
    "Dicit me sic ostentatum multo magis admirationem moturum, et rumores de novo animali domestico iam diffundi."

# game/a1s4.rpy:16
translate latin a1s4_bb12b63c:

    # "That's another thing: my involvement in the trial."
    "Aliud quoque est: partes meae in certamine."

# game/a1s4.rpy:17
translate latin a1s4_bd7f6ab9:

    # "Apparently, I'm to be his partner in the dance portion, something I have no clue how to do."
    "Ut videtur, socius eius in parte saltationis futurus sum, quam facere omnino nescio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:18
translate latin a1s4_3a112711:

    # "I've been getting more and more worried about it, telling Amicus he actually needs to show me what I'm going to be doing, but he brushes me off, telling me it's no big deal."
    "Magis magisque sollicitor, Amico dicens eum mihi re vera ostendere debere quid facturus sim; sed me neglegit, dicens nihil magni esse."

# game/a1s4.rpy:19
translate latin a1s4_882f00c7:

    # "Apparently, the dancing is rather easy, and the main objective is just to show me off."
    "Saltatio satis facilis esse dicitur; praecipuum consilium est tantum me ostentare."

# game/a1s4.rpy:20
translate latin a1s4_c27bb5d2:

    # "Since everyone already knows what Alex is, I should be rather impressive to the officials that will be judging us."
    "Cum omnes iam sciant quid Alex sit, ego magistratibus qui nos iudicaturi sunt satis admirationis movere debeo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:21
translate latin a1s4_5b2bdc28:

    # "Amicus is confident that we'll win that portion of the contest easily."
    "Amicus confidit nos illam certaminis partem facile victuros esse."

# game/a1s4.rpy:22
translate latin a1s4_15cff1a2:

    # "Still, he promises me at least a few sessions of practice before the actual day of the competition."
    "Tamen promittit nos saltem aliquotiens exercitaturos esse ante ipsam diem certaminis."

# game/a1s4.rpy:23
translate latin a1s4_eee9db35:

    # "I realize now that that's only three days away, and despite Amicus's constant reassurances, I can feel the stress building."
    "Iam intellego tantum triduum usque ad eam diem restare; quamquam Amicus assidue me confirmat, sollicitudinem augeri sentio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:24
translate latin a1s4_0c2cf206:

    # "I can only trust him that the dance is actually easy and simply an opportunity to show me off."
    "Tantum ei credere possum saltationem vere facilem esse et occasionem tantum me ostentandi."

# game/a1s4.rpy:25
translate latin a1s4_d04fcdf3:

    # "Meanwhile, half of my days tend to be empty of things to do."
    "Interea dimidia fere dierum meorum pars rebus agendis vacua esse solet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:26
translate latin a1s4_385dee59:

    # "I'm left on my own to either hang around in Amicus's room, have conversations with Com about Adastra and its culture, or just try and busy myself with menial work."
    "Solus relinquor, ut aut in cubiculo Amici morer, aut cum Com de Adastra cultuque eius colloquar, aut vilibus operibus me occupare coner."

# game/a1s4.rpy:30
translate latin a1s4_42b238ad:

    # "Sometimes I hang out with Alex which I enjoy, but lately I wonder if the idea that we're technically going to be competing against each other is causing a bit of a rift between us."
    "Interdum cum Alex versor, quod mihi placet; sed nuper quaero an cogitatio nos, si rem proprie spectes, alterum contra alterum certaturos esse paulum nos disiungat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:31
translate latin a1s4_8211b931:

    # "Still, I get a lot of time with him since Cassius is out just as much as Amicus, if not more."
    "Tamen multum temporis cum eo ago, quia Cassius non minus quam Amicus abest, fortasse etiam magis."

# game/a1s4.rpy:32
translate latin a1s4_4462c3cd:

    # "We go out into the gardens a few times and other times we watch Adastran TV together, sometimes even catching Amicus or Cassius giving speeches to the seemingly endless crowds of wolves."
    "Aliquotiens in hortos imus; alias televisionem Adastranam simul spectamus, interdum etiam Amicum aut Cassium orationes ad turbas luporum quasi infinitas habentem videmus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:33
translate latin a1s4_56ce3da5:

    # "The broadcasters seem to like tallying up numbers, and it's clear that Cassius always has an edge."
    "Qui spectacula emittunt numeros computare amare videntur, atque manifestum est Cassium semper praestare."

# game/a1s4.rpy:34
translate latin a1s4_052ef015:

    # "Still, from what I've gathered, Amicus has had a bit of surge and manages to at least do better than half Cassius's numbers."
    "Tamen, quantum collegi, Amicus aliquantum profecit et numeros obtinet qui saltem dimidiam partem numerorum Cassii superant."

# game/a1s4.rpy:35
translate latin a1s4_da4a2fe1:

    # "It's still a little worrying though, but from what I can tell, popularity doesn't factor into the trials."
    "Id adhuc paulum sollicitat, sed quantum intellego favor popularis in certaminibus non numeratur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:36
translate latin a1s4_71a7ff59:

    # "When I'm not with Alex, I try to avoid running into any of the others, which is actually pretty easy."
    "Quando cum Alex non sum, ceteris occurrere vitare conor, quod re vera satis facile est."

# game/a1s4.rpy:40
translate latin a1s4_0883a092:

    # "Cato is almost always absent from the palace, doing his own official business as acting emperor."
    "Cato paene semper a palatio abest, sua munera officialia agens dum imperatoris munere ad tempus fungitur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:44
translate latin a1s4_bcb10eaf:

    # "Virginia hasn't bothered to talk to me after our first interaction, probably deeming me incapable of any sort of conversation."
    "Virginia post primum congressum nostrum mecum loqui non curavit, probabiliter putans me nullius sermonis capacem esse."

# game/a1s4.rpy:48
translate latin a1s4_25850858:

    # "Neferu, on the other hand, is the one person I have difficulty avoiding."
    "Neferu autem solus est quem vitare difficile mihi est."

# game/a1s4.rpy:49
translate latin a1s4_432e5f9c:

    # "Unlike the others, he greets me when he sees me, and occasionally sticks out his paw so that I have to kiss it."
    "Dissimilis ceteris, me salutat cum videt, et interdum manum porrigit ut eam osculari debeam."

# game/a1s4.rpy:50
translate latin a1s4_6611f139:

    # "The only difference now is that after I do it, he does the same to me."
    "Unum tantum iam differt: postquam feci, ille mihi idem facit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:51
translate latin a1s4_d406dd0d:

    # "I think I gave him the false impression that it's some sort of normal greeting for my people."
    "Credo me falsam opinionem ei dedisse hanc quandam solitam salutationem gentis meae esse."

# game/a1s4.rpy:52
translate latin a1s4_fb44e097:

    # "He seems to enjoy it quite a bit, but only tries it when Amicus isn't around."
    "Eo satis delectari videtur, sed tantum temptat cum Amicus abest."

# game/a1s4.rpy:56
translate latin a1s4_6bf7f279:

    # "As for Cassius, I don't see him for the entire week...until today."
    "Cassium autem per totam hebdomadem non video... usque ad hunc diem."

# game/a1s4.rpy:59
translate latin a1s4_ad2afe86:

    # "I'm in the dining room, watching the screens and zoning out."
    "In triclinio sum, tabulas visuales mente absente spectans."

# game/a1s4.rpy:60
translate latin a1s4_9b6adc7e:

    # "The wolves are pretty talented at making basically all of their films incredibly boring."
    "Lupi sane periti sunt paene omnes pelliculas suas incredibiliter taediosas faciendi."

# game/a1s4.rpy:61
translate latin a1s4_08247aa1:

    # "It's probably something to do with the long-winded monologues and theatrical acting."
    "Probabiliter ad longos monologos et histrionum theatralem actionem pertinet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:62
translate latin a1s4_104ba7ec:

    # "Alex is gone today, doing some type of ambassador work in the city while Amicus is out with Cato, training, though he's supposed to be back in the next hour to give me that dance practice he's promised."
    "Alex hodie abest, munere quodam legati in urbe fungens; Amicus autem cum Catone foris exercetur, quamquam intra horam proximam redire debet ut saltationis exercitationem promissam mihi praebeat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:63
translate latin a1s4_c236ef29:

    # "I'm nodding off and thinking about heading back to Amicus's room to take a quick nap when Cassius suddenly comes in."
    "Dormitare incipio et cogito ad cubiculum Amici redire ut paulisper dormiam, cum Cassius subito intrat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:65
translate latin a1s4_05d48110:

    # "He stalks in with that particular stiff gait that he has, along with his usual sour expression."
    "Rigido illo proprio gressu incedit, solito vultu acido."

# game/a1s4.rpy:66
translate latin a1s4_37e9b786:

    # "Even though it's been a while since I've seen him, I haven't forgotten that look of his."
    "Quamquam aliquamdiu eum non vidi, vultum eius non oblitus sum."

# game/a1s4.rpy:67
translate latin a1s4_71b6262c:

    # "I jump and quickly sit up straight, looking at the ground."
    "Expavesco et celeriter rectus in sede me erigo, solum aspiciens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:68
translate latin a1s4_877f8912:

    # "There's only a moment of silence before his reedy voice breaks it."
    "Breve tantum silentium est, antequam vox eius gracilis id rumpit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:69
translate latin a1s4_bc2a2a28:

    # c "\"Pet! Come with me.\""
    c "\"Animal domesticum! Veni mecum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:70
translate latin a1s4_3e109413:

    # "And with that, he turns and stalks right back out of the room."
    "His dictis se vertit et statim e conclavi rursus iratus incedit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:72
translate latin a1s4_78e6683b:

    # "I sit there, stunned for a moment."
    "Paulisper ibi attonitus sedeo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:73
translate latin a1s4_0678f6c3:

    # "First of all, Amicus told Cassius never to give me commands."
    "Primum Amicus Cassio dixit ne mihi umquam imperaret."

# game/a1s4.rpy:74
translate latin a1s4_d930c85a:

    # "Does that mean that I shouldn't listen to him?"
    "Significatne id me ei parere non debere?"

# game/a1s4.rpy:75
translate latin a1s4_5cc32981:

    # "I know immediately that that wouldn't be a very good idea, and I jump off my bed to hurry out into the hall."
    "Statim scio id non valde prudens fore; e lecto subsilio ut in andronem festinem."

# game/a1s4.rpy:76
translate latin a1s4_2c70a3e0:

    # "The important thing is that Amicus isn't here right now, and I know that Cassius is not someone I want to piss off."
    "Hoc magni momenti est: Amicus nunc hic non est, et scio Cassium non esse quem irritare velim."

# game/a1s4.rpy:77
translate latin a1s4_e8e0caee:

    # "I still remember how quickly he suggested he hit me as punishment."
    "Adhuc memini quam celeriter suaserit ut me poenae causa percuteret."

# game/a1s4.rpy:83
translate latin a1s4_5eb8b225:

    # "I'm just in time to see his white tail disappear around a corner and I jog after him, noting just how confident he is that I'll follow him without question."
    "Vix tempore advenio ut caudam eius albam post angulum evanescentem videam; post eum cursim eo, animadvertens quam confidat me sine interrogatione secuturum esse."

# game/a1s4.rpy:84
translate latin a1s4_727cc54e:

    # "I don't think he's even looked back once."
    "Non puto eum vel semel respexisse."

# game/a1s4.rpy:88
translate latin a1s4_41c10bc1:

    # "I realize that we're heading out into the gardens, toward the same tables and benches that Alex and I have eaten our lunches at a few times."
    "Intellego nos in hortos ire, ad easdem mensas et scamna apud quae ego et Alex aliquotiens prandimus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:92
translate latin a1s4_a61316f6:

    # "That's when I see Virginia and Neferu sitting down already, cups and plates already on the table."
    "Tum Virginiam et Neferu iam sedentes video, poculis patellisque iam in mensa positis."

# game/a1s4.rpy:93
translate latin a1s4_597923f3:

    # "I realize then what it is Cassius summoned me for, and I relax a bit."
    "Tum intellego cur Cassius me arcessiverit, atque paulum relaxor."

# game/a1s4.rpy:94
translate latin a1s4_518592b8:

    # "After serving breakfast so many times, I know exactly what's expected of me."
    "Postquam totiens ientaculum ministravi, exacte scio quid a me exspectetur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:95
translate latin a1s4_799b4a1b:

    # "When Virginia spots us, she waves at Cassius, but he only grumbles under his breath."
    "Cum Virginia nos videt, Cassium manu salutat; ille autem tantum summissa voce murmurat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:96
translate latin a1s4_c754783b:

    # c "\"Ugh...why is he here?\""
    c "\"Ugh... cur ille hic est?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:97
translate latin a1s4_078b0c03:

    # "I see the wolf's tail lash around in irritation before it settles as we get closer to the pair."
    "Caudam lupi irritati ultro citroque verberari video, deinde quiescere dum ad ambos propius accedimus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:99
translate latin a1s4_c6c2bc95:

    # c "\"Good morning, Virginia...\""
    c "\"Bonum mane, Virginia...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:101
translate latin a1s4_5a39c52c:

    # c "\"...and Neferu.\""
    c "\"...et Neferu.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:102
translate latin a1s4_580ccb24:

    # "Cassius's voice takes on a dismissive tone as he says the Jackal's name, barely even nodding his head at him."
    "Vox Cassii contemptum ostendit cum chacali nomen pronuntiat, vix capite ei annuens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:104
translate latin a1s4_a93c00e3:

    # n "\"Ahhotep be with you, Cassius. How are you this day?\""
    n "\"Ahhotep tecum sit, Cassi. Quomodo hodie te habes?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:105
translate latin a1s4_1185fc2a:

    # "Cassius's tail lashes again, but only once."
    "Cauda Cassii iterum verberat, sed tantum semel."

# game/a1s4.rpy:106
translate latin a1s4_1627e556:

    # c "\"Wonderful. Virginia, you didn't tell me we'd be having a guest.\""
    c "\"Mirifice. Virginia, non mihi dixisti nos hospitem habituros esse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:107
translate latin a1s4_3b9c54c0:

    # "Virginia raises a brow."
    "Virginia alterum supercilium tollit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:109
translate latin a1s4_b1a2063e:

    # v "\"I'm sorry, did you need a warning of some kind, Cassius?\""
    v "\"Ignosce, num aliqua admonitione egere te putabas, Cassi?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:110
translate latin a1s4_b890d1d6:

    # "Cassius sits, leaning back in the chair as he keeps his gaze on Virginia."
    "Cassius considit et in sede reclinatur, oculis in Virginia defixis."

# game/a1s4.rpy:112
translate latin a1s4_982b1c9d:

    # c "\"I simply like to be prepared.\""
    c "\"Tantum paratus esse amo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:116
translate latin a1s4_830c6b31:

    # "There's a moment of silence and Neferu, still smiling, looks back and forth between the brother and sister."
    "Paulisper silentium est; Neferu, adhuc subridens, modo fratrem, modo sororem aspicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:118
translate latin a1s4_58e76cb8:

    # n "\"I'm sorry, am I causing an inconvenience?\""
    n "\"Ignoscite, num molestiam affero?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:120
translate latin a1s4_8a593a3e:

    # v "\"No, Neferu. Cassius is simply being his usual, gloomy self.\""
    v "\"Non, Neferu. Cassius tantum solito more tristis est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:122
translate latin a1s4_88e7e98f:

    # "Cassius's paws, which are clasped on the table, tighten their grip on each other."
    "Manus Cassii, in mensa iunctae, altera alteram arctius prehendunt."

# game/a1s4.rpy:123
translate latin a1s4_96ab46f7:

    # "Virginia doesn't seem to notice though, and instead looks up at me."
    "Virginia tamen non animadvertere videtur, potius me sursum aspiciens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:125
translate latin a1s4_c743cc91:

    # v "\"And you brought [mc]?\""
    v "\"Et [mc] adduxisti?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:126
translate latin a1s4_262f8931:

    # "Cassius doesn't even look at me."
    "Cassius ne me quidem aspicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:127
translate latin a1s4_b22a2ce0:

    # c "\"I'm borrowing him. My pet is doing diplomatic work in the city.\""
    c "\"Mutuor eum. Animal meum domesticum munera diplomatica in urbe agit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:128
translate latin a1s4_33d8d813:

    # "Virginia rolls her eyes."
    "Virginia oculos circumvertit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:129
translate latin a1s4_8c686ebe:

    # v "\"Really, Cassius, you can't manage to serve yourself even once?\""
    v "\"Re vera, Cassi, ne semel quidem tibi ipsi ministrare potes?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:131
translate latin a1s4_30658ac6:

    # c "\"If I am to be emperor, I need to act like one...and please leave questioning me for another time. I don't want to be rude to our guest.\""
    c "\"Si imperator futurus sum, ut imperator agere debeo... et, quaeso, interrogationes tuas in aliud tempus differ. Hospitem nostrum inurbanitate offendere nolo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:136
translate latin a1s4_9b780d8b:

    # "Cassius smiles at Neferu, though it looks forced."
    "Cassius Neferu arridet, quamquam risus coactus videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:137
translate latin a1s4_274cb148:

    # "Another moment of tense silence."
    "Aliud breve silentium intentum."

# game/a1s4.rpy:138
translate latin a1s4_b580499c:

    # "I take it as an opportunity to do my work."
    "Occasionem esse puto officium meum agendi."

# game/a1s4.rpy:139
translate latin a1s4_18b332f1:

    # m "\"Me...serve now?\""
    m "\"Me... nunc ministrare?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:140
translate latin a1s4_4de9d154:

    # "I almost snicker at my own caveman speech."
    "Paene ad proprium sermonem quasi hominis speluncae subrideo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:142
translate latin a1s4_2a8f6003:

    # c "\"Yes, pet.\""
    c "\"Ita, animal domesticum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:143
translate latin a1s4_707d2f80:

    # "I go about serving him, picking up slices of baked and seasoned bread off the platter before setting them on a smaller plate."
    "Ei ministrare incipio, panis cocti et aromatibus conditi crustas e lance sumens, antequam in patella minore pono."

# game/a1s4.rpy:144
translate latin a1s4_93f70988:

    # "I set this in front of Cassius."
    "Hanc ante Cassium pono."

# game/a1s4.rpy:145
translate latin a1s4_a9e1c930:

    # "Then I pour some tea out of the heated pot into Cassius's cup before finally stepping back, hands clasped together."
    "Tum potionem theanam e vase calefacto in poculum Cassii infundo, deinde tandem recedo, manibus iunctis."

# game/a1s4.rpy:146
translate latin a1s4_57d57af7:

    # "Luckily, Cassius and Virginia act like I'm not there, carrying on their conversation."
    "Feliciter Cassius et Virginia quasi non adsim agunt, sermonem suum continuantes."

# game/a1s4.rpy:147
translate latin a1s4_3202644e:

    # "Only Neferu seems to be constantly aware of my presence, occasionally glancing at me."
    "Solus Neferu assidue me adesse scire videtur, interdum me breviter aspiciens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:148
translate latin a1s4_3c07a984:

    # c "\"Are you...enjoying your stay here, Neferu?\""
    c "\"Num... commoratione tua hic frueris, Neferu?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:149
translate latin a1s4_48476d7a:

    # "Neferu snaps his gaze from me to Cassius."
    "Neferu oculos subito a me ad Cassium vertit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:151
translate latin a1s4_99bf4989:

    # n "\"Oh yes, very much so. You've all been so hospitable to me. I thank you.\""
    n "\"O, ita, valde. Omnes tam hospitaliter me accepistis. Gratias vobis ago.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:152
translate latin a1s4_8790625b:

    # "Cassius waves his paw."
    "Cassius manum agitat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:154
translate latin a1s4_c7c4050f:

    # c "\"It's the Wolven way, Neferu. No thanks are needed.\""
    c "\"Mos Luporum est, Neferu. Gratias agere non necesse est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:156
translate latin a1s4_6b74603a:

    # "Another moment of silence stretches out before Virginia reaches for a plate."
    "Aliud silentium protrahitur, antequam Virginia manum ad patellam porrigit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:157
translate latin a1s4_7813ab1b:

    # v "\"Can I get you some pananem Neferu?\""
    v "\"Possumne tibi paulum pananem dare, Neferu?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:158
translate latin a1s4_98d75274:

    # "But Neferu suddenly stands up."
    "Sed Neferu subito surgit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:160
translate latin a1s4_19262807:

    # n "\"Actually, I should be on my way. I can tell that you intended to speak with your sister alone, Cassius. Good day, and good day to you, [mc].\""
    n "\"Re vera mihi abeundum est. Intellego te cum sorore tua solo loqui voluisse, Cassi. Bonum diem, et tibi quoque bonum diem, [mc].\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:161
translate latin a1s4_638e7c61:

    # "I jump, but quickly duck my head in response."
    "Expavesco, sed celeriter caput responsi loco demitto."

# game/a1s4.rpy:165
translate latin a1s4_29074cdd:

    # "Neferu then wanders off into the gardens, paws behind his back as he disappears behind the bushes and flowers."
    "Neferu deinde in hortos vagatur, manibus post tergum positis, donec post frutices floresque evanescit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:166
translate latin a1s4_ab943b6c:

    # "Cassius looks after him, his ears lowered, the insides slightly red."
    "Cassius eum abeuntem aspicit, auribus demissis, partibus interioribus leviter rubris."

# game/a1s4.rpy:168
translate latin a1s4_be8fc7f4:

    # c "\"He's rather blunt, isn't he?\""
    c "\"Satis abrupte loquitur, nonne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:169
translate latin a1s4_546c7375:

    # "Virginia doesn't respond, and Cassius looks over to see that she's glaring at him."
    "Virginia non respondet; Cassius eo aspicit et eam se torve intuentem videt."

# game/a1s4.rpy:171
translate latin a1s4_fb70ab3e:

    # c "\"What?\""
    c "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:172
translate latin a1s4_bce696ee:

    # v "\"He is our GUEST, Cassius. Start treating him like one.\""
    v "\"HOSPES noster est, Cassi. Incipe eum ut hospitem tractare.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:174
translate latin a1s4_149dfede:

    # c "\"Wh—I—hmph...\""
    c "\"Qu—ego—hmph...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:175
translate latin a1s4_799c0bc2:

    # "Cassius sighs and looks away, pouting."
    "Cassius suspirat et oculos avertit, labris protrusis."

# game/a1s4.rpy:176
translate latin a1s4_50d43ceb:

    # "Virginia takes a sip of her tea before leaning back in her chair, letting the silence drag on a bit before finally speaking."
    "Virginia paulum potionis theanae sorbet, deinde in sede reclinatur; silentium aliquamdiu protrahi sinit antequam tandem loquitur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:178
translate latin a1s4_d2daa352:

    # v "\"What is it, Cassius?\""
    v "\"Quid est, Cassi?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:180
translate latin a1s4_dd3c65b1:

    # c "\"What is what?\""
    c "\"Quid est quid?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:181
translate latin a1s4_efc2df90:

    # v "\"Why are you sulking more than the usual?\""
    v "\"Cur solito magis tristis es?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:182
translate latin a1s4_db0b4204:

    # "Cassius sighs."
    "Cassius suspirat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:184
translate latin a1s4_bf65c54d:

    # c "\"I am very busy, Virginia, and I freed up this portion of my day to have good conversation. I've barely spoken to you since you returned, and I wanted to ask about your trip.\""
    c "\"Valde occupatus sum, Virginia, et hanc diei partem liberam feci ut bono sermone frueremur. Vix tecum locutus sum ex quo redisti, atque de itinere tuo quaerere volebam.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:185
translate latin a1s4_e69baa7e:

    # "Cassius takes a brisk sip from his cup."
    "Cassius celeriter e poculo sorbet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:187
translate latin a1s4_d4ea2fb0:

    # c "\"It's difficult to speak intimately when others are around, especially those of a different species.\""
    c "\"Difficile est familiariter loqui cum alii adsunt, praesertim alienae speciei.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:188
translate latin a1s4_02ee3bfe:

    # v "\"Cassius, if you wanted to speak alone, you only had to ask. I was simply worried that Neferu is growing bored of the palace, so I invited him along.\""
    v "\"Cassi, si solus loqui volebas, tantum rogandum erat. Solum verebar ne Neferu palatii taederet, itaque eum invitavi.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:190
translate latin a1s4_4bb03327:

    # "Virginia grins."
    "Virginia late arridet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:191
translate latin a1s4_4a6deeec:

    # v "\"And you don't have to play emperor around me. I'm your sister. Lean back and relax a little bit.\""
    v "\"Et coram me imperatorem agere non debes. Soror tua sum. Reclina te et paulum relaxare.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:192
translate latin a1s4_d74cb3e3:

    # "Cassius sighs again, but doesn't lean back."
    "Cassius iterum suspirat, sed non reclinatur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:193
translate latin a1s4_82538fac:

    # c "\"I must play the role I intend to fit even when the situation does not call for it.\""
    c "\"Partes quas suscipere intendo etiam agere debeo cum res id non postulat.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:194
translate latin a1s4_498db39f:

    # v "\"You think father was always like that?\""
    v "\"Putas patrem semper talem fuisse?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:195
translate latin a1s4_915f887d:

    # c "\"I don't know, he did not speak to me much.\""
    c "\"Nescio; non multum mecum loquebatur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:197
translate latin a1s4_9f15f80d:

    # v "\"Well, he wasn't. You can relax around me, Cassius.\""
    v "\"Bene, non erat. Coram me relaxare potes, Cassi.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:198
translate latin a1s4_106276ad:

    # "Cassius sighs and eats one of the crackers, leaning back into his chair very slightly."
    "Cassius suspirat et unum ex crustulis edit, in sede levissime reclinatus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:202
translate latin a1s4_93270d58:

    # c "\"So how was Lux?\""
    c "\"Quomodo res Luce se habebant?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:204
translate latin a1s4_57cec03c:

    # v "\"Oh, you know; riots and crime and complaints about a lack of funding.\""
    v "\"O, scis: seditiones, scelera et querelae de pecuniae inopia.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:205
translate latin a1s4_e5e5262f:

    # c "\"Well, there is a lack of funding.\""
    c "\"Bene, pecuniae inopia sane est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:206
translate latin a1s4_a41adfd0:

    # v "\"There is a lack of funds, certainly, but not from us. You know the officials there are corrupt and take most of it.\""
    v "\"Pecuniae quidem inopia est, sed non quia nos non suppeditamus. Scis magistratus ibi corruptos esse maximamque partem sibi sumere.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:208
translate latin a1s4_3e9362d3:

    # c "\"That isn't the people's fault.\""
    c "\"Ista non est populi culpa.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:209
translate latin a1s4_50d247ce:

    # v "\"No, but they should choose their politicians more carefully. They're electing officials based on how outrageous they can be. How does that result in a sound government?\""
    v "\"Non, sed eos qui rem publicam gerant cautius eligere debent. Magistratus eligunt secundum quantam insolentiam ostendere possunt. Quomodo inde stabile regimen oritur?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:211
translate latin a1s4_363dd66c:

    # c "\"The people are frustrated and the sentiment is spreading throughout the empire. I've been telling you this for years.\""
    c "\"Populus frustratus est, et ille animi habitus per totum imperium diffunditur. Hoc iam per annos tibi dico.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:212
translate latin a1s4_49031764:

    # v "\"Certainly, we all know this. The question is how to fix it.\""
    v "\"Certe, omnes id scimus. Quaeritur quomodo rem corrigamus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:214
translate latin a1s4_1d67dcd1:

    # c "\"By getting rid of the triumvirates the people elect. If we ruled directly, the empire would become as sound as the palace we govern from.\""
    c "\"Triumviratus tollendo quos populus eligit. Si ipsi recta regeremus, imperium tam stabile fieret quam palatium ex quo gubernamus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:216
translate latin a1s4_323b46c4:

    # v "\"Mmmh, and you expect to do that easily?\""
    v "\"Mmmh, et id facile effecturum te putas?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:217
translate latin a1s4_8223d729:

    # c "\"I expect it to be very, very difficult and it's something I intend to do very, very carefully. The people need direction, and electing chaotic triumvirates is their cry for help.\""
    c "\"Valde, valde difficile fore puto, et rem valde, valde caute agere intendo. Populus ductu eget; triumviros turbidos eligendo auxilium petit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:221
translate latin a1s4_ed976eb8:

    # "Virginia doesn't say anything, instead taking a very dainty sip of tea from her cup."
    "Virginia nihil dicit, potius potionem theanam e poculo delicatissime sorbens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:222
translate latin a1s4_cd97f4fb:

    # "Cassius clears his throat and sits up straight again."
    "Cassius tussicula fauces purgat et rursus rectus sedet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:224
translate latin a1s4_4eb8e4c3:

    # c "\"Anyway...why did you decide to bring this Khemian back with you? You never explained it clearly in your letters.\""
    c "\"Utut est... cur hunc Khemianum tecum reducere statuisti? Numquam in litteris tuis clare explicavisti.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:225
translate latin a1s4_9444b1af:

    # v "\"But I did. His accommodations in Lux were rather poor. Bringing him here and acquainting him with the imperial family seemed like the natural decision to me.\""
    v "\"Immo explicavi. Hospitium eius Luce satis miserum erat. Eum huc ducere et familiae imperiali assuefacere naturale consilium mihi videbatur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:227
translate latin a1s4_3be7f90b:

    # v "\"You know he's the pharaoh's second son?\""
    v "\"Scis eum secundum pharaonis filium esse?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:229
translate latin a1s4_1a9de235:

    # c "\"Yes, but why was he in Lux and why didn't I know about it?\""
    c "\"Ita, sed cur Luce erat et cur ego id nesciebam?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:230
translate latin a1s4_eae6bfd0:

    # "Viginia shrugs."
    "Virginia umeros tollit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:232
translate latin a1s4_c699456f:

    # v "\"You can't expect to know about every diplomatic visit that there is. Anyway, he was touring the Siblings and was in Lux when the Depletion happened.\""
    v "\"Non potes exspectare te de omni visitatione diplomatica sciturum esse. Utut est, Fratres circumibat et Luce erat cum Defectus accidit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:233
translate latin a1s4_50e063c7:

    # c "\"My question is why wouldn't the pharaoh send a ship immediately to retrieve his own son? Alex makes sense, being your typical diplomat, but the son of a pharaoh?\""
    c "\"Ego quaero cur pharao statim navem non miserit ut filium suum repeteret. Alex, qui legatus usitatus est, intellegi potest; sed filius pharaonis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:234
translate latin a1s4_344b2b88:

    # v "\"He chose to stay.\""
    v "\"Manere elegit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:235
translate latin a1s4_36748628:

    # "Cassius snorts."
    "Cassius naribus fremit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:237
translate latin a1s4_c88c9dd9:

    # c "\"And why would he do that?\""
    c "\"Et cur id faciat?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:238
translate latin a1s4_52fb0c10:

    # "Virginia stares at Cassius for a moment, a frown on her face."
    "Virginia paulisper Cassium intente aspicit, fronte corrugata."

# game/a1s4.rpy:240
translate latin a1s4_7e6af5bf:

    # v "\"Cassius, you know the reason as well as I do. Despite the absolute chaotic, bankrupt, Parent-less mess our empire is in, the Khemians are willing to ally with us. He's trying to help establish that.\""
    v "\"Cassi, causam non minus quam ego nosti. Quamvis imperium nostrum prorsus turbatum, pecunia exhaustum et Parentibus orbum sit, Khemiani foedus nobiscum facere volunt. Hoc efficere conatur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:242
translate latin a1s4_6ba51d85:

    # c "\"They are taking advantage of us when we're at our weakest, Virginia. You know how I feel about this and that I have no plans for an alliance.\""
    c "\"Nobis abutuntur cum infirmissimi sumus, Virginia. Scis quid de hac re sentiam neque mihi ullum consilium foederis esse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:243
translate latin a1s4_5335f7f8:

    # v "\"I'm planning for all scenarios, Cassius, and as of now, you aren't guaranteed the emperorship.\""
    v "\"Ad omnes rerum casus consilia paro, Cassi; nunc autem imperium tibi nondum certum est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:245
translate latin a1s4_9b21cc50:

    # "Cassius doesn't say anything, staring at his empty plate."
    "Cassius nihil dicit, patellam suam vacuam intuens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:246
translate latin a1s4_607e3644:

    # "Slowly, I walk up to the table and refill the plate."
    "Lente ad mensam accedo et patellam rursus impleo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:247
translate latin a1s4_1f4742e7:

    # "Neither of the wolves look at me."
    "Neuter lupus me aspicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:249
translate latin a1s4_77b7b4d4:

    # v "\"We should be grateful the Khemians even want to speak to us. None of the other siblings wants to be associated with a race that seems to have been abandoned.\""
    v "\"Grati esse debemus quod Khemiani vel nobiscum loqui volunt. Nullus aliorum Fratrum cum gente coniungi vult quae deserta esse videtur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:251
translate latin a1s4_4c563e0c:

    # c "\"We don't know that yet.\""
    c "\"Id nondum scimus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:252
translate latin a1s4_e6cd8e70:

    # v "\"Well, they aren't speaking to us, are they? And they left us star-bound. If this is permanent, we may never be able to travel beyond the star system again.\""
    v "\"Bene, nobiscum non loquuntur, nonne? Et nos intra systema stellae nostrae reliquerunt. Si hoc perpetuum est, fortasse numquam ultra systema rursus iter facere poterimus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:253
translate latin a1s4_fa4a3da8:

    # "That catches my attention."
    "Hoc animum meum advertit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:254
translate latin a1s4_8e35ef96:

    # "Didn't Amicus tell me that when he becomes emperor he'd be able to take me back?"
    "Nonne Amicus mihi dixit se, cum imperator fieret, me reducere posse?"

# game/a1s4.rpy:255
translate latin a1s4_8ea236a0:

    # "They're acting like they won't have the Stretch Drive forever..."
    "Quasi Propulsor Distensionis perpetuo eis defuturus sit agunt..."

# game/a1s4.rpy:256
translate latin a1s4_204270dd:

    # "Cassius laughs."
    "Cassius ridet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:258
translate latin a1s4_9189b58b:

    # c "\"Once we have a new emperor, they will give us guidance again. They stopped immediately after father's death. What other explanation could there be?\""
    c "\"Cum novum imperatorem habuerimus, nobis rursus ductum praebebunt. Statim post patris mortem desierunt. Quae alia explicatio esse potest?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:259
translate latin a1s4_2045eeab:

    # v "\"They didn't after grandfather's death.\""
    v "\"Post avi mortem non desierunt.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:260
translate latin a1s4_7e4e4957:

    # "Cassius waves his paw in the air."
    "Cassius manum in aere agitat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:261
translate latin a1s4_f281b55b:

    # c "\"Because father was in line for the throne without any challenge. The emperorship has not been in limbo like this in living memory. They are simply waiting for the empire to have firm leadership again before re-establishing contact.\""
    c "\"Quia pater sine adversario thronum accepturus erat. Imperii successio numquam ita incerta fuit, quantum vivi meminerunt. Tantum exspectant ut imperium rursus firmum ductum habeat antequam contactum restituant.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:262
translate latin a1s4_6879c0df:

    # "Cassius snatches a cracker off of the plate I just refilled."
    "Cassius crustulum e patella capit quam modo implevi."

# game/a1s4.rpy:264
translate latin a1s4_6459b3ca:

    # c "\"It has happened before, even if that was before Drusus. But even if we're not able to, I have no doubt that I can still lead this empire to prosperity.\""
    c "\"Id antea accidit, etsi ante Drusum. Sed etiam si non poterimus, minime dubito me hoc imperium adhuc ad prosperitatem ducere posse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:266
translate latin a1s4_6429682e:

    # v "\"And how would we do that without the Stretch? We'd not be able to communicate with our children anymore.\""
    v "\"Et quomodo id sine Distensione faciamus? Cum Liberis nostris iam communicare non possemus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:268
translate latin a1s4_b29b7290:

    # c "\"If the Khemians learned the Stretch, then so can we. As for our children, abandon them. They've only been a burden anyway. \""
    c "\"Si Khemiani Distensionem didicerunt, nos quoque possumus. Liberos autem deseramus. Tantum oneri nobis fuerunt. \""

# game/a1s4.rpy:269
translate latin a1s4_d063edca:

    # "Cassius glances at me and I quickly look down at the ground."
    "Cassius me breviter aspicit, et ego celeriter deorsum in solum aspicio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:270
translate latin a1s4_4034cbdc:

    # "Virginia sighs loudly."
    "Virginia clare suspirat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:272
translate latin a1s4_b26187a3:

    # v "\"Sometimes the things you say frighten me, Cassius.\""
    v "\"Interdum ea quae dicis me terrent, Cassi.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:274
translate latin a1s4_d2f45680:

    # c "\"Well, you know it would be less so if you were on my side, Virginia.\""
    c "\"Bene, scis minus te terrerent si a parte mea stares, Virginia.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:275
translate latin a1s4_ce2c7943:

    # v "\"I'm on no one's side, Cassius. It's my duty to serve the emperor, no matter who that might be.\""
    v "\"Nullius partibus faveo, Cassi. Officium meum est imperatori servire, quicumque ille sit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:277
translate latin a1s4_28dee0f0:

    # c "\"You are on Amicus's side. It's clear as Vita.\""
    c "\"Amico faves. Tam clarum est quam Vita.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:279
translate latin a1s4_295cedf7:

    # v "\"Preference does not matter in the end. I don't like Cato, yet I serve him.\""
    v "\"Quis mihi magis placeat denique nihil refert. Cato mihi displicet, tamen ei servio.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:280
translate latin a1s4_a4136e92:

    # "Cassius's ears flatten and he looks around."
    "Aures Cassii demittuntur et ille circum aspicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:282
translate latin a1s4_64b637df:

    # c "\"Lower your voice when you say such things, Virginia...and are you saying you dislike me like you do Cato?\""
    c "\"Vocem demitte cum talia dicis, Virginia... et dicisne me tibi displicere sicut Cato displicet?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:283
translate latin a1s4_527ab930:

    # v "\"Well of course not, but like I said, your ideas are extreme.\""
    v "\"Certe non; sed, ut dixi, consilia tua extrema sunt.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:285
translate latin a1s4_4af1fd89:

    # c "\"Radical ideas are needed for times like these. It's how I've gotten so far with the people.\""
    c "\"Consiliis radicalibus temporibus talibus opus est. Ita tam longe apud populum profeci.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:286
translate latin a1s4_c58af1bb:

    # v "\"Well, just remember that you and Amicus are both my brothers, and I love you equally...just be civil when the decision is made.\""
    v "\"Bene, tantum memento te et Amicum ambos fratres meos esse, et me aeque vos amare... tantum civiliter age cum consilium captum erit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:289
translate latin a1s4_b9e58b62:

    # a "\"CASSIUS!\""
    a "\"CASSI!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:290
translate latin a1s4_8df85e0c:

    # "We all jump as Amicus's voice seems to rattle the ivy on the pillars."
    "Omnes expavescimus, cum vox Amici quasi hederam in columnis quatiat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:291
translate latin a1s4_197c32c5:

    # "Cassius settles back in his seat, rolling his eyes."
    "Cassius rursus in sede reclinatur, oculos circumvertens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:295
translate latin a1s4_64eb3695:

    # c "\"What, Amicus?\""
    c "\"Quid, Amice?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:296
translate latin a1s4_2c40b262:

    # a "\"What the hell are you doing with my pet!? Com says you have him!\""
    a "\"Quid malum cum animali meo domestico agis!? Com dicit te eum habere!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:297
translate latin a1s4_6fef70f5:

    # c "\"He wanted to serve me. How could I deny him?\""
    c "\"Mihi ministrare voluit. Quomodo negare potui?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:298
translate latin a1s4_80f4f300:

    # a "\"Do not lie to me, Cassius. I told you never to talk to him!\""
    a "\"Noli mihi mentiri, Cassi. Dixi tibi ne umquam cum eo loquereris!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:299
translate latin a1s4_aaad4d5d:

    # c "\"Are you going to yell at me or tell me where you are so I can send him back?\""
    c "\"Clamabisne in me an dices ubi sis, ut eum remittere possim?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:300
translate latin a1s4_52208429:

    # a "\"Where are you!? I'm going to come out there.\""
    a "\"Ubi es!? Illuc foras veniam.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:302
translate latin a1s4_fa7eec24:

    # "Cassius does look a little worried then."
    "Cassius tum aliquantum sollicitus videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:303
translate latin a1s4_a1a51422:

    # c "\"Com, where is Amicus?\""
    c "\"Com, ubi Amicus est?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:304
translate latin a1s4_b007f999:

    # com "\"The main hall, Cassius.\""
    com "\"In aula principali, Cassi.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:305
translate latin a1s4_764dd9c5:

    # a "\"I'm coming out!\""
    a "\"Foras venio!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:307
translate latin a1s4_2107597c:

    # c "\"Pet, go back inside and do NOT tell him where we are.\""
    c "\"Animal domesticum, redi intus et NOLI ei dicere ubi simus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:310
translate latin a1s4_091a023a:

    # "Cassius shoos me away while Virginia just chuckles behind a paw."
    "Cassius gestu me abigit, dum Virginia tantum post manum subridet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:314
translate latin a1s4_13b3a419:

    # "I make my way back inside, though Amicus meets me right at the entrance."
    "Intus redeo, sed Amicus in ipso aditu mihi occurrit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:315
translate latin a1s4_f9b45a88:

    # "He glares."
    "Torve aspicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:317
translate latin a1s4_29d106b4:

    # a "\"What the hell does he think he's doing!? What did he make you do?\""
    a "\"Quid malum se agere putat!? Quid te facere coegit?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:318
translate latin a1s4_81fc3c34:

    # "Amicus sets a paw on my shoulder, looking me over."
    "Amicus manum super umerum meum ponit et me inspicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:319
translate latin a1s4_6cfe3eb1:

    # m "\"Not much. I just served him while he talked to Virginia.\""
    m "\"Non multum. Tantum ei ministravi dum cum Virginia loquebatur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:321
translate latin a1s4_fd27b3af:

    # a "\"Unbelievable.\""
    a "\"Incredibile.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:322
translate latin a1s4_54320557:

    # "Amicus makes as if to walk out into the gardens."
    "Amicus in hortos exire incipere videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:323
translate latin a1s4_4bd61dc2:

    # m "\"Where are you going?\""
    m "\"Quo vadis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:325
translate latin a1s4_416fe731:

    # a "\"Going to give Cass a piece of my mind. I SPECIFICALLY told him not to—\""
    a "\"Cass severe obiurgaturus sum. DISERTE ei dixi ne—\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:326
translate latin a1s4_aea74eb2:

    # "I set a hand on his arm, stopping him."
    "Manum super bracchium eius pono, eum sistens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:327
translate latin a1s4_6695cec6:

    # m "\"Hey, it's fine.\""
    m "\"Heus, nihil est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:329
translate latin a1s4_e5b4eaa8:

    # a "\"Is it? Because last I remember, he threatened to HIT you.\""
    a "\"Num vero nihil est? Quantum memini, te PERCUTERE minatus est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:330
translate latin a1s4_e294a4fe:

    # m "\"He didn't touch me at all. He ignored me the whole time.\""
    m "\"Omnino me non tetigit. Toto tempore me neglexit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:331
translate latin a1s4_2b941fb9:

    # "Amicus looks out into the gardens, still clearly wanting to go out there."
    "Amicus in hortos prospicit, adhuc plane eo exire cupiens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:332
translate latin a1s4_c850b3e5:

    # m "\"Listen, I just want to get this dance practice done. I've been worried about it all week.\""
    m "\"Audi, tantum hanc saltationis exercitationem peragere volo. Iam per totam hebdomadem de ea sollicitus sum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:333
translate latin a1s4_5e02cd98:

    # "Amicus pauses, then sighs, turning back to walk into the palace."
    "Amicus consistit, deinde suspirat et se convertit ut in palatium redeat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:335
translate latin a1s4_7ce7be90:

    # a "\"Fine, but when I let Cassius get away with things like this, he tends to push it even further the next time.\""
    a "\"Bene, sed cum Cassium talia impune agere sino, proxima vice etiam longius progredi solet.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:336
translate latin a1s4_d3de1f62:

    # "We walk in silence for a bit, our footsteps echoing like they always do in the marble halls."
    "Paulisper taciti ambulamus, gradibus nostris in andronibus marmoreis solito more resonantibus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:337
translate latin a1s4_23aa788a:

    # m "\"Are you alright?\""
    m "\"Bene vales?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:339
translate latin a1s4_1932d517:

    # a "\"I'm fine, why?\""
    a "\"Bene valeo, cur?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:340
translate latin a1s4_079e0fa3:

    # m "\"Well, you seem a little grumpy?\""
    m "\"Bene, paulo morosus videris?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:342
translate latin a1s4_ad7fa592:

    # a "\"It was just a long day in the city. Unlike Cassius, speeches don't come naturally to me. Something I just need to get used to.\""
    a "\"Tantum longus dies in urbe fuit. Mihi, secus ac Cassio, orationes non sponte faciles sunt. Huic rei tantum assuescendum est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:343
translate latin a1s4_306e3183:

    # "I walk alongside the wolf, feeling his furry arm brush up against mine."
    "Iuxta lupum ambulo, sentiens bracchium eius pilosum meum leniter tangere."

# game/a1s4.rpy:344
translate latin a1s4_4e53afa3:

    # m "\"So...when do I get to go to the city?\""
    m "\"Ergo... quando in urbem ire potero?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:345
translate latin a1s4_716f14fd:

    # "The wolf tilts his muzzle down at me in surprise."
    "Lupus miratus rostrum ad me deorsum inclinat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:347
translate latin a1s4_98896357:

    # a "\"Oh? You want to go?\""
    a "\"O? Ire vis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:348
translate latin a1s4_597ad325:

    # m "\"Well yeah. Didn't you say I could? It's kind of getting boring here.\""
    m "\"Bene, ita. Nonne dixisti me posse? Hic aliquantum taediosum fit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:350
translate latin a1s4_289e2c3f:

    # a "\"Well, I'd say once the first trial is done. You'd be introduced to the public by then, so everyone will know who you are when we go.\""
    a "\"Bene, dixerim post primum certamen. Iam populo ostentatus eris, itaque omnes scient quis sis cum ibimus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:351
translate latin a1s4_7aefdb4b:

    # m "\"Can I plan on that, then?\""
    m "\"Ergo hoc certum habere possum?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:353
translate latin a1s4_408f4143:

    # a "\"Of course! I'm just surprised that you want to see the city so badly!\""
    a "\"Certe! Tantum miror te tam cupere urbem videre!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:354
translate latin a1s4_7660c65d:

    # m "\"Well, looking at it from the balcony all the time has me curious.\""
    m "\"Bene, eam semper e maeniano spectare me curiosum facit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:355
translate latin a1s4_d9b61498:

    # a "\"Heh, well visually it's not all that impressive; there are cities out there with larger structures and attractions. Adastra is mostly a city for imperial officers and their families. Still, we could find some entertainment, I'm sure.\""
    a "\"Heh, aspectu non tam mirabilis est: aliae urbes sunt aedificiis et locis visitandis maioribus. Adastra maxime urbs est officialibus imperii familiisque eorum destinata. Tamen aliquid iucundum invenire possimus, certo scio.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:356
translate latin a1s4_ac901ad1:

    # m "\"As long as it isn't like the films I've seen on your TV.\""
    m "\"Dummodo non simile sit pelliculis quas in televisione vestra vidi.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:358
translate latin a1s4_9de27df8:

    # a "\"Well, it would be live entertainment, but it would be somewhat similar...Actually, if you don't like that, then you may not like the dance I'm about to show you.\""
    a "\"Bene, spectaculum coram actum foret, sed aliquantum simile... re vera, si id tibi displicet, fortasse etiam saltatio quam tibi mox ostendam displicebit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:359
translate latin a1s4_aee9accd:

    # "I realize then that we're walking in a new direction in the palace, down a hall I haven't been through since Alex gave me the palace tour."
    "Tum intellego nos in palatio novam partem petere, per andronem quo non transieram ex quo Alex me per palatium circumduxit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:360
translate latin a1s4_3b69c6f6:

    # m "\"Where are we going?\""
    m "\"Quo imus?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:362
translate latin a1s4_2094639e:

    # a "\"The throne room! Should be empty right now. It's where we'll be performing!\""
    a "\"In conclave throni! Nunc vacuum esse puto. Ibi spectaculum dabimus!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:363
translate latin a1s4_8bc20ac9:

    # "I feel myself getting a little nervous as we approach a large set of double doors."
    "Aliquantum nervosus fio, dum ad magnas fores geminas accedimus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:364
translate latin a1s4_e49e4365:

    # "Amicus presses his paw to the black panel and they slide open."
    "Amicus manum ad tabulam nigram premit, et fores labendo aperiuntur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:368
translate latin a1s4_a44de08c:

    # "Inside, I'm greeted by the largest room in the palace that I've seen yet."
    "Intus maximum conclave palatii mihi occurrit quod adhuc vidi."

# game/a1s4.rpy:369
translate latin a1s4_ff178802:

    # "I look up the glistening walls, craning my neck to see the ceiling arch dozens of meters above us."
    "Parietes nitentes sursum aspicio, collum extendens ut cameram multis decenis metrorum supra nos arcuatam videam."

# game/a1s4.rpy:370
translate latin a1s4_54841c27:

    # "Afternoon light filters through the windows, lighting up the place in a warm, orange glow."
    "Lux postmeridiana per fenestras leniter intrat, locum calido fulgore aurantiaco illuminans."

# game/a1s4.rpy:371
translate latin a1s4_8c4e5c77:

    # m "\"Wow.\""
    m "\"O.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:374
translate latin a1s4_8590c28a:

    # a "\"You like it?\""
    a "\"Tibi placet?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:375
translate latin a1s4_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:376
translate latin a1s4_71fe9c01:

    # "I look at the throne, framed by pillars and crystals that appear to be levitating."
    "Thronum aspicio, columnis et crystallis circumdatum quae levitare videntur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:377
translate latin a1s4_bc0ce6ac:

    # "The crystals look similar to other structures in the palace that are used mainly for a light source."
    "Crystalla aliis structuris in palatio similia sunt, quae maxime ut fontes lucis adhibentur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:378
translate latin a1s4_af2711ab:

    # "It's just that these ones are a lot bigger."
    "Tantum haec multo maiora sunt."

# game/a1s4.rpy:379
translate latin a1s4_54b337e7:

    # "Amicus walks into the center of the room, our footsteps sounding much more cavernous here."
    "Amicus in medium conclave ambulat, gradibus nostris hic multo magis quasi in caverna resonantibus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:381
translate latin a1s4_4814c723:

    # a "\"We actually don't use it very often. It's more for tradition.\""
    a "\"Re vera non saepe eo utimur. Potius traditionis causa est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:382
translate latin a1s4_84d1bd1f:

    # m "\"So you won't sit on the throne all day yelling at people?\""
    m "\"Ergo non toto die in throno sedebis in alios clamans?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:384
translate latin a1s4_6267265b:

    # a "\"Sadly, no. I can only remember a handful of times that father sat in it.\""
    a "\"Infeliciter, non. Paucas tantum vices memini quibus pater ibi sedit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:385
translate latin a1s4_592c67d9:

    # "I look around a bit, spinning in a slow circle."
    "Circum paulum aspicio, me lente in orbem vertens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:387
translate latin a1s4_d022cce4:

    # "When I see Amicus again, he's quiet."
    "Cum Amicum rursus video, tacet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:388
translate latin a1s4_479db590:

    # "His arms are folded as he stares at the throne."
    "Bracchiis complicatis thronum intente aspicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:389
translate latin a1s4_b25bab82:

    # "The look on his face tells me that he's deep in thought."
    "Vultus eius ostendit eum penitus cogitare."

# game/a1s4.rpy:390
translate latin a1s4_12d30e6b:

    # "I clear my throat."
    "Tussicula fauces purgo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:391
translate latin a1s4_47b19d0d:

    # m "\"Um, so did you want to show me the dance?\""
    m "\"Eh, ergo saltationem mihi ostendere volebas?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:393
translate latin a1s4_1e70efdc:

    # a "\"Oh, right.\""
    a "\"O, recte.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:394
translate latin a1s4_e942a96a:

    # "Amicus walks toward me until he's standing just a few feet away."
    "Amicus ad me ambulat donec paucis tantum pedibus abest."

# game/a1s4.rpy:396
translate latin a1s4_35ac7f23:

    # "He sighs, then frowns, his ears down."
    "Suspirat, deinde frontem corrugat, auribus demissis."

# game/a1s4.rpy:397
translate latin a1s4_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:398
translate latin a1s4_79868be9:

    # a "\"Erm...\""
    a "\"Eh...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:399
translate latin a1s4_d5940b07:

    # "I wait, but he doesn't say anything."
    "Exspecto, sed nihil dicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:400
translate latin a1s4_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:401
translate latin a1s4_a187ebcb:

    # "I say it a little more loudly, feeling nervous."
    "Paulo clarius dico, sollicitus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:402
translate latin a1s4_0fb53a3f:

    # a "\"Well...\""
    a "\"Bene...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:403
translate latin a1s4_f139c1a9:

    # m "\"Seriously, you're stressing me out.\""
    m "\"Serio, me sollicitudine afficis.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:405
translate latin a1s4_b557a16d:

    # a "\"Alright, listen. The role you'll be playing might seem a bit strange to you.\""
    a "\"Bene, audi. Partes quas ages tibi aliquantum mirae videri possunt.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:406
translate latin a1s4_e3601a45:

    # m "\"Role? What do you mean by that?\""
    m "\"Partes? Quid eo significas?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:407
translate latin a1s4_578b6e07:

    # "Amicus takes a deep breath, as if only now realizing what our practice session is going to involve."
    "Amicus alte spiritum ducit, quasi nunc demum intellegat quid exercitatio nostra complectatur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:408
translate latin a1s4_ac74e7b6:

    # a "\"The dance we'll be doing is titled Meera, and it will involve things that you might find objectionable.\""
    a "\"Saltatio quam agemus Meera inscribitur, atque res complectetur quae tibi displicere possint.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:409
translate latin a1s4_71dc505c:

    # m "\"Objectionable?\""
    m "\"Displicere?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:410
translate latin a1s4_1bcb60d5:

    # a "\"Alright...let me try to explain this correctly. Basically, we will be playing the roles of Drusus and Meera, an emperor and his lover.\""
    a "\"Bene... conabor hoc recte explicare. Fere partes Drusi et Meerae agemus, imperatoris et amantis eius.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:411
translate latin a1s4_5439bcee:

    # m "\"Wait...so this is like a play, or a musical? I'm playing a character?\""
    m "\"Exspecta... ergo hoc quasi fabula scaenica est, aut fabula musica? Personam ago?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:412
translate latin a1s4_17aa23f7:

    # a "\"Well of course, it's a dance.\""
    a "\"Certe, saltatio est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:413
translate latin a1s4_b7d33012:

    # m "\"Well, I guess, but you never told me that I'd also be acting.\""
    m "\"Bene, credo, sed numquam dixisti me quoque partes histrionis acturum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:414
translate latin a1s4_3f887172:

    # a "\"Isn't acting part of dancing? What's the point of dance if you're not telling a story?\""
    a "\"Nonne actio histrionis saltationis pars est? Quid prodest saltare, nisi fabulam narras?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:415
translate latin a1s4_f17896b3:

    # "I cover my face with my hands, rubbing it in frustration."
    "Faciem manibus tego et irritatus frico."

# game/a1s4.rpy:416
translate latin a1s4_bc06a581:

    # m "\"Listen, quit saying these things to me like I should just know it. We're from different worlds; of course things aren't the same on Earth.\""
    m "\"Audi, desine mihi haec dicere quasi iam scire debeam. Ex diversis mundis sumus; certe res in Terra non eaedem sunt.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:418
translate latin a1s4_cd9bc656:

    # a "\"Ah yes, you're right. I'm sorry. I'm just...you're so much like a wolf that I forget.\""
    a "\"Ah, ita, recte dicis. Ignosce. Tantum... tam lupo similis es ut obliviscar.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:419
translate latin a1s4_050d81f5:

    # m "\"It's fine, but what is it that I'd find objectionable?\""
    m "\"Nihil est; sed quidnam est quod mihi displicere possit?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:420
translate latin a1s4_f20c8b1a:

    # "I remember his description of the dance included the word \"lover\"."
    "Memini eum saltationem describentem verbo \"amans\" usum esse."

# game/a1s4.rpy:421
translate latin a1s4_04938c87:

    # m "\"Wait, what sort of things am I gonna have to do with you?\""
    m "\"Exspecta, quae res tecum facere debebo?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:422
translate latin a1s4_20f789db:

    # "The look on Amicus's face worries me."
    "Vultus Amici me sollicitat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:423
translate latin a1s4_c7094c9e:

    # "I feel myself getting angry, realizing now why Amicus had put this off for so long."
    "Irasci incipio, iam intellegens cur Amicus hoc tam diu distulerit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:424
translate latin a1s4_af78b41c:

    # "I glare at him."
    "Eum torve aspicio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:425
translate latin a1s4_8ebc384e:

    # a "\"Nothing too explicit! But...there's caressing and...and a kiss at the end.\""
    a "\"Nihil nimis apertum! Sed... mulcendo te tangam et... et osculum in fine erit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:426
translate latin a1s4_55efe36e:

    # m "\"Oh my god.\""
    m "\"O deus meus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:427
translate latin a1s4_110eaaab:

    # "I let my head drop, closing my eyes."
    "Caput demitto, oculis clausis."

# game/a1s4.rpy:428
translate latin a1s4_62f67d96:

    # a "\"I'm sorry! I just...I don't make up the dances or the rules, it's simply tradition.\""
    a "\"Ignosce! Tantum... saltationes aut leges non ipse excogito; traditio tantum est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:429
translate latin a1s4_475e7fc9:

    # "I let the silence drag out, letting Amicus squirm."
    "Silentium protrahi sino, ut Amicus incommodus se moveat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:430
translate latin a1s4_554cefcc:

    # "But weirdly enough, I'm not as angry as I thought I'd be."
    "Miro tamen modo non tam iratus sum quam putaveram me fore."

# game/a1s4.rpy:431
translate latin a1s4_524eebf1:

    # "Knowing Amicus for the two weeks I've been here, I guess I kind of just expect it from him."
    "Amicum per duas hebdomades quibus hic fui cognoscens, credo me talia ab eo quodammodo iam exspectare."

# game/a1s4.rpy:432
translate latin a1s4_4e136f22:

    # "Still, he's been nothing but respectful to me over the past few weeks, and if it means I can go home..."
    "Tamen his hebdomadibus praeteritis nihil nisi observantiam erga me praestitit; et, si hoc mihi domum redire permittat..."

# game/a1s4.rpy:433
translate latin a1s4_f17233b5:

    # m "\"Is that it? You caress me a little and...kiss me at the end?\""
    m "\"Tantum id? Me paulum mulces et... in fine oscularis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:434
translate latin a1s4_307756a7:

    # a "\"For the most part, yes...and you're playing the role of a female, so you must dress a certain way.\""
    a "\"Plerumque, ita... et partes feminae agis, itaque certo modo vestiendus es.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:435
translate latin a1s4_92bfb06a:

    # m "\"Are you kidding me?\""
    m "\"Ludisne me?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:436
translate latin a1s4_1dfbe86f:

    # "I feel my face flush red, something that Amicus has told me is kind of unnerving to see for someone covered in fur."
    "Faciem meam rubescere sentio; Amicus mihi dixit id aliquantum perturbare eum qui pilis tegatur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:437
translate latin a1s4_80dd851a:

    # m "\"Why do {i}I{/i} have to do it then? Go get a female dancer, or something. A professional would do this way better than me!\""
    m "\"Cur ergo {i}ego{/i} id facere debeo? Saltatricem aliquam arcesse aut tale quid. Perita multo melius quam ego hoc faceret!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:439
translate latin a1s4_6ba5374f:

    # a "\"That's not the point of the trial. Me teaching you is part of it...and it's simply the role of the pet to do so.\""
    a "\"Non id agitur in certamine. Me te docere pars eius est... et tantum munus animalis domestici est ita facere.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:440
translate latin a1s4_752ab6f1:

    # m "\"You should have told me this last week, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Hoc superiore hebdomade mihi dicere debuisti, Amice.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:442
translate latin a1s4_2f028b4f:

    # "Amicus doesn't seem to have an answer for that besides a mumbled \"sorry\"."
    "Amicus nihil respondere posse videtur, praeter \"ignosce\" summissa voce dictum."

# game/a1s4.rpy:443
translate latin a1s4_8a0db39b:

    # "We stand there in awkward silence for a little while longer before Amicus squares his shoulders."
    "Aliquantum diutius in incommodo silentio stamus, antequam Amicus umeros componit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:445
translate latin a1s4_c613c900:

    # a "\"Listen, I will not force you to do anything you don't want to, that I promise...\""
    a "\"Audi, non cogam te quidquam facere quod non velis; hoc promitto...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:446
translate latin a1s4_37209350:

    # m "\"But?\""
    m "\"Sed?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:447
translate latin a1s4_7a207f51:

    # a "\"But doing this dance convincingly is needed for us to win.\""
    a "\"Sed hanc saltationem ita agere ut spectatores credant necesse est, si vincere volumus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:448
translate latin a1s4_837c0258:

    # "I sigh loudly."
    "Clare suspiro."

# game/a1s4.rpy:449
translate latin a1s4_86ef20b8:

    # m "\"Who's even judging this?\""
    m "\"Qui tandem hoc iudicant?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:450
translate latin a1s4_c9b7c986:

    # a "\"Cato and triumvirates from the five other major cities.\""
    a "\"Cato et triumviri quinque aliarum urbium maiorum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:451
translate latin a1s4_41e730b6:

    # m "\"Triumvirates?\""
    m "\"Triumviratus?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:452
translate latin a1s4_1c01a82c:

    # a "\"Groups of three that govern the cities.\""
    a "\"Terni qui urbes regunt.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:453
translate latin a1s4_99e7fcc1:

    # m "\"So why do you even have to know music or dance to become an emperor anyway?\""
    m "\"Cur ergo musicae aut saltationis peritus esse debes ut imperator fias?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:455
translate latin a1s4_d5fc74a9:

    # a "\"Well, the more well-rounded the wolf, the better he is for the emperorship. An emperor that can fight just as well as he can dance shows good character!\""
    a "\"Bene, quo pluribus artibus lupus pollet, eo aptior imperio est. Imperator qui aeque bene pugnat ac saltat bonum ingenium ostendit!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:456
translate latin a1s4_16db98e6:

    # m "\"Alright...fine. Just show me the dance.\""
    m "\"Bene... fiat. Tantum saltationem ostende mihi.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:458
translate latin a1s4_4fe841a9:

    # "Amicus lets out one of those relieved sighs that he seems to have reserved just for me."
    "Amicus unum ex illis suspiriis levamenti emittit, quae mihi tantum reservasse videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:460
translate latin a1s4_066977c9:

    # a "\"Thank you. Again, I'm sorry. I was just so busy with official business and everything else...I didn't know how to approach you about this.\""
    a "\"Gratias. Iterum ignosce. Tam occupatus eram muneribus officialibus et omnibus aliis... nesciebam quomodo de hac re ad te accederem.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:461
translate latin a1s4_cd8984ff:

    # m "\"Well next time just tell me. I'm honestly more annoyed that you waited so long. Isn't the trial in a few days?\""
    m "\"Bene, proxima vice tantum dic mihi. Re vera magis me irritat quod tam diu exspectavisti. Nonne certamen post paucos dies est?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:462
translate latin a1s4_343d72a1:

    # a "\"Three days.\""
    a "\"Post tres dies.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:463
translate latin a1s4_8e732c02:

    # m "\"Great.\""
    m "\"Optime.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:465
translate latin a1s4_27d8d4cf:

    # a "\"But it's a simple dance! You'll be able to learn it in a few hours, then we can practice tomorrow too.\""
    a "\"Sed saltatio simplex est! Paucis horis eam discere poteris, tum cras quoque exercere possumus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:466
translate latin a1s4_6f19d038:

    # m "\"Alright.\""
    m "\"Bene.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:467
translate latin a1s4_02513e4d:

    # "I look around."
    "Circumspicio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:468
translate latin a1s4_c90a4a6e:

    # m "\"So do we have music, or something?\""
    m "\"Ergo musicam aut tale quid habemus?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:470
translate latin a1s4_503b2ce6:

    # a "\"Uhh, no, we don't need music, do we?\""
    a "\"Ehh, non; musica non egemus, nonne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:471
translate latin a1s4_ad68bf03:

    # m "\"I mean, I guess not. On Earth, we usually dance to music...without having to tell a story.\""
    m "\"Scilicet, credo non. In Terra plerumque ad musicam saltamus... neque fabulam narrare debemus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:472
translate latin a1s4_ce7da4ae:

    # a "\"Oh really? So you just dance for no reason?\""
    a "\"O, re vera? Ergo tantum sine causa saltatis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:473
translate latin a1s4_6f953621:

    # m "\"Kind of. We usually dance to have fun.\""
    m "\"Quodammodo. Plerumque voluptatis causa saltamus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:474
translate latin a1s4_99b7e493:

    # a "\"So why do you need music?\""
    a "\"Cur ergo musica egetis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:475
translate latin a1s4_a5ed7e8b:

    # "I think."
    "Cogito."

# game/a1s4.rpy:476
translate latin a1s4_0c56640e:

    # "It's such a basic thing, but I've never had to explain it to anyone before, so I find myself trying to figure out the right way to go about it."
    "Res tam simplex est, sed numquam antea cuiquam explicare debui; itaque nunc rectam explicandi rationem invenire conor."

# game/a1s4.rpy:477
translate latin a1s4_ef93c1ab:

    # m "\"Well, we need a beat, or a rhythm to dance to. I mean, not always, but usually we move to an even spaced beat.\""
    m "\"Bene, pulsu aut rhythmo egemus ad quem saltemus. Scilicet, non semper, sed plerumque ad pulsus aequalibus intervallis positos movemur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:478
translate latin a1s4_c5d5a011:

    # "Amicus absorbs that for a second, then chuckles."
    "Amicus hoc paulisper animo percipit, deinde subridet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:480
translate latin a1s4_c502cda2:

    # a "\"Hehe.\""
    a "\"Hehe.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:481
translate latin a1s4_df8ec4bc_2:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:483
translate latin a1s4_cb0282bc:

    # a "\"It's such a primate thing to do, to bang sticks and rocks together. You love your rhythms. It just sounds so...um...interesting. \""
    a "\"Tam proprium primatum est baculos et lapides inter se percutere. Rhythmos vestros amatis. Tantum tam... eh... mirum sonat. \""

# game/a1s4.rpy:484
translate latin a1s4_9b5383a6:

    # "I frown, immediately picking up on the condescension."
    "Frontem corrugo, statim contemptum sub verbis sentiens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:485
translate latin a1s4_5e0ac596:

    # m "\"You mean primitive?\""
    m "\"Rude dicis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:487
translate latin a1s4_af42dbf7:

    # a "\"No! Just...different.\""
    a "\"Non! Tantum... diversum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:488
translate latin a1s4_ba5e326f:

    # "I sigh, letting it go for now."
    "Suspiro, hanc rem nunc omittens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:489
translate latin a1s4_62a60694:

    # "At least he's trying, I guess."
    "Credo eum saltem conari."

# game/a1s4.rpy:491
translate latin a1s4_4352a736:

    # a "\"Anyway, we're going to have an orator narrate the story for us. It's a combination of speaking and singing. I'll do that for now, though...well, not the singing. I'll just speak.\""
    a "\"Utut est, oratorem habebimus qui fabulam nobis narret. Sermo et cantus coniunguntur. Nunc ego faciam... quamquam, bene, non cantabo. Tantum loquar.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:492
translate latin a1s4_7325e041:

    # "I stand there waiting, and Amicus coughs awkwardly."
    "Exspectans ibi sto, et Amicus incommodus tussit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:494
translate latin a1s4_f30a759d:

    # a "\"Anyway—\""
    a "\"Utut est—\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:495
translate latin a1s4_efbcf273:

    # "Amicus reaches out a paw and I take it after a short pause."
    "Amicus manum porrigit; ego post brevem moram capio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:498
translate latin a1s4_f485f47c:

    # "Slowly, he draws me closer to himself, to the point that I can smell the lavender and floral mouthwash on his breath."
    "Lente me propius ad se trahit, adeo ut in spiritu eius lavandulam et loturam oris floribus odoratam sentire possim."

# game/a1s4.rpy:499
translate latin a1s4_04528b01:

    # a "\"I'm going to lead you through the movements first while narrating, then we'll start from the beginning again, alright?\""
    a "\"Primum te per motus ducam dum narro, deinde ab initio rursus incipiemus, bene?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:500
translate latin a1s4_63fd2624:

    # "I nod in agreement, and with that, Amicus starts to narrate the story."
    "Assentiens annuo, et Amicus fabulam narrare incipit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:503
translate latin a1s4_b3c5ecb8:

    # a "\"Ten thousand years ago, our empire was small, shriveled, and parent-less. We abandoned them, and were left to drift through the galaxy alone.\""
    a "\"Decem milia annorum abhinc imperium nostrum parvum erat, extenuatum et Parentibus orbum. Nos illos deseruimus, et soli per galaxiam vagari relicti sumus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:504
translate latin a1s4_c2a2e890:

    # "Amicus turns me away from him to face the throne, his paw on my shoulder."
    "Amicus me a se avertit ut thronum aspiciam, manu eius super umerum meum posita."

# game/a1s4.rpy:505
translate latin a1s4_90b50fea:

    # a "\"Then Drusus, our dear emperor, came along and made a proposition—\""
    a "\"Tum Drusus, carus imperator noster, venit et consilium proposuit—\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:506
translate latin a1s4_0b9a68b6:

    # "Amicus steps forward lightly, on his toes, gesturing broadly with his paw."
    "Amicus leviter in summis pedum digitis procedit, manu late gesticulans."

# game/a1s4.rpy:507
translate latin a1s4_a23746c8:

    # a "\"Let us reconnect with our parent, and through them, the rest of the universe...But it was not so easy. The siblings, long tired of Wolven hubris, were reluctant to know them again.\""
    a "\"Rursus cum Parente nostro coniungamur, et per eum cum reliquo universo... Sed non tam facile fuit. Fratres, iam diu arrogantiae Luporum pertaesi, cum eis iterum consuescere gravabantur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:508
translate latin a1s4_d3cde895:

    # "I stand there awkwardly, watching Amicus move around me in a sort of interpretive dance, mostly involving prancing and big gestures with his paws."
    "Incommodus ibi sto, Amicum circa me in quadam saltatione res exprimente moventem spectans; maxime in summis pedibus salit et manibus late gesticulatur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:509
translate latin a1s4_d4fbfd8c:

    # a "\"That was until he met Meera, a Hindo sibling.\""
    a "\"Id duravit donec Meeram convenit, Hindo e gradu Fratrum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:510
translate latin a1s4_1f239731:

    # "Amicus turns to me then, stretching out a paw again, this time flat, like he's telling me to stop."
    "Tum Amicus ad me vertitur et manum rursus porrigit, hac vice planam, quasi me consistere iubeat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:511
translate latin a1s4_26ee796d:

    # a "\"Alright, so just reach out the same way and press your paw to mine.\""
    a "\"Bene, tantum eodem modo manum porrige et ad meam preme.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:512
translate latin a1s4_147576df:

    # "I do as he asks, watching as his massive paw almost seems to envelop mine."
    "Facio quod rogat, spectans manum eius ingentem meam paene involvere."

# game/a1s4.rpy:513
translate latin a1s4_ed3a68df:

    # "He slowly pushes my hand upward, drawing me closer as he does."
    "Lente manum meam sursum impellit, me simul propius ad se trahens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:514
translate latin a1s4_3cffb5b2:

    # a "\"And before they could help it, they'd fallen in love—\""
    a "\"Et antequam se continere possent, mutuo amore capti erant—\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:515
translate latin a1s4_e1943f78:

    # "The story goes on for a while, Amicus teaching me the steps and hand movements as it does."
    "Fabula aliquamdiu progreditur; Amicus interea gradus et manuum motus mihi docet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:516
translate latin a1s4_7a8be3e0:

    # "The process is slow and tedious, but Amicus is patient with me and tells me that it's not the choreography that's necessarily important, but rather the feeling and passion we put into the movements."
    "Ratio lenta est et taediosa, sed Amicus patienter mecum agit; dicit non ipsam motuum ordinationem potissimum valere, sed affectum et ardorem quos in motus ponimus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:517
translate latin a1s4_6d8b481f:

    # "The story describes Meera and Drusus's relationship, evolving from one of official, diplomatic business to true love."
    "Fabula necessitudinem Meerae et Drusi describit, a negotiis officialibus diplomaticisque ad verum amorem crescentem."

# game/a1s4.rpy:518
translate latin a1s4_5005ac6b:

    # "But it doesn't last long because Meera becomes sick from an unspecified illness and is about to die."
    "Sed non diu durat, quia Meera morbo quodam non definito aegrotat et mox moritura est."

# game/a1s4.rpy:519
translate latin a1s4_3f43f13e:

    # "The parents offer Drusus two options; save Meera, or save his empire and promise his people prosperity for the next ten thousand years."
    "Parentes Druso duas condiciones offerunt: aut Meeram servare, aut imperium suum servare et populo suo prosperitatem per decem milia annorum proxima polliceri."

# game/a1s4.rpy:520
translate latin a1s4_6477b28c:

    # "Drusus wants to choose Meera, even if it means damning his empire for millennia."
    "Drusus Meeram eligere vult, quamquam id imperium suum per millennia damnare significet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:521
translate latin a1s4_d4162ba0:

    # "At this point in the story, Amicus draws me in to his chest, my back pressed to his front as he holds me close, his voice rumbling in his chest."
    "Hoc fabulae loco Amicus me ad pectus suum attrahit, dorso meo contra partem anteriorem eius presso; arcte me tenet, voce eius in pectore resonante."

# game/a1s4.rpy:522
translate latin a1s4_c171fbb8:

    # "Then the story takes a sudden turn; Meera denies Drusus his own decision, instead taking her own life so that his empire might survive."
    "Tum fabula subito vertitur: Meera Drusum suo consilio uti non sinit, potius sibi mortem consciscens ut imperium eius superesse possit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:523
translate latin a1s4_304b64d3:

    # "Here, I'm supposed to put the back of my hand to my head, like I'm an old-timey woman in a corset passing out."
    "Hic dorsum manus meae ad caput ponere debeo, quasi femina prisci temporis in corsetto animo deficiens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:524
translate latin a1s4_324eb6a1:

    # "Amicus carefully lowers me to the ground, laying me flat on my back."
    "Amicus me caute in solum demittit, supinum plane collocans."

# game/a1s4.rpy:525
translate latin a1s4_6e035f90:

    # a "\"And so it was that another sibling saved our empire. Drusus was forced into his one remaining choice, which was no longer a choice—\""
    a "\"Ita alius e Fratribus imperium nostrum servavit. Drusus ad unam reliquam condicionem compulsus est, quae iam electio non erat—\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:526
translate latin a1s4_14ff21ec:

    # "Amicus stands slowly, raising a paw to the sky, pointing."
    "Amicus lente surgit, manum ad caelum tollens et digito indicans."

# game/a1s4.rpy:528
translate latin a1s4_3f02b8ae:

    # a "\"'To the stars', he said. We are now Adastra.\""
    a "\"'Ad astra', dixit. Iam Adastra sumus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:529
translate latin a1s4_e11f7f16:

    # "Amicus holds the pose for a moment, then looks down at me."
    "Amicus paulisper habitum corporis retinet, deinde me deorsum aspicit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:530
translate latin a1s4_774fc6c1:

    # m "\"Is...that it?\""
    m "\"Id... tantum est?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:532
translate latin a1s4_bcc81977:

    # a "\"Yes.\""
    a "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:533
translate latin a1s4_d66099ad:

    # "I sit up and Amicus reaches down to help me to my feet."
    "Me sublevo et sedeo; Amicus manum deorsum porrigit ut me in pedes iuvet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:534
translate latin a1s4_c2cad88e:

    # a "\"Wasn't so bad, was it?\""
    a "\"Non tam malum erat, nonne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:535
translate latin a1s4_7f2e2674:

    # m "\"Well, no not really. As long as it doesn't matter if I don't do all the steps right.\""
    m "\"Bene, non, non re vera. Dummodo nihil intersit si non omnes gradus recte facio.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:536
translate latin a1s4_95414a85:

    # a "\"No, you just need to have a general idea of it. Remember, it's the feeling you need to get right, the tragedy of it all.\""
    a "\"Non; tantum fere rem intellegere debes. Memento affectum tibi recte exprimendum esse, totius rei tragoediam.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:537
translate latin a1s4_fc1e8e8d:

    # m "\"So is that story true? Seems like a weird choice to give someone...and he made a really stupid decision. He basically killed Meera.\""
    m "\"Ergo fabula vera est? Mira condicio alicui data videtur... et ille stultissimum consilium cepit. Fere Meeram necavit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:538
translate latin a1s4_f887bb98:

    # "Amicus shrugs."
    "Amicus umeros tollit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:539
translate latin a1s4_caecff95:

    # a "\"It's mostly just a dramatic story, but Drusus was a real person, and so was Meera. She did take her own life, but we don't really know why, or the extent of their relationship.\""
    a "\"Plerumque fabula dramatica tantum est; sed Drusus vere vixit, item Meera. Illa sibi mortem conscivit, sed non re vera scimus cur, neque quam ampla necessitudo eorum fuerit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:540
translate latin a1s4_fc13cf39:

    # m "\"Hm, and what about the kiss? You said the dance would involve that?\""
    m "\"Hm, et quid de osculo? Dixisti saltationem id complecti?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:542
translate latin a1s4_4cf822e7:

    # a "\"Uh, thought we should leave that for the actual performance. I assume you don't want me kissing you over and over?\""
    a "\"Eh, putabam id usque ad ipsum spectaculum relinquendum. Credo te nolle me iterum atque iterum osculari?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:543
translate latin a1s4_5e8aaa81:

    # m "\"Yeah, that's probably for the best.\""
    m "\"Ita, id probabiliter optimum est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:545
translate latin a1s4_579fd279:

    # a "\"Anyway, let's do it a few more times and get you into the feel of it before we focus on the acting portion tomorrow.\""
    a "\"Utut est, aliquotiens iteremus ut affectui eius assuescas, antequam cras ad partes histrionum animum intendamus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:547
translate latin a1s4_1df63975:

    # "For the next few hours ,we go through the steps over and over."
    "Per proximas paucas horas gradus iterum atque iterum peragimus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:548
translate latin a1s4_380100f2:

    # "By the end, we're both kind of sweaty, being so close to each other while Vita shines in on us."
    "In fine ambo aliquantum sudamus, quia tam prope inter nos sumus dum Vita super nos lucet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:550
translate latin a1s4_8cc49b44:

    # a "\"Alright...why don't we take a break.\""
    a "\"Bene... cur non quiescimus?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:551
translate latin a1s4_910f899d:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Sane.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:553
translate latin a1s4_8d60b4d8:

    # a "\"Would you like to go to the communal bath?\""
    a "\"Visne ad balneum commune ire?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:554
translate latin a1s4_cae9591a:

    # m "\"Where everyone takes a bath together?\""
    m "\"Ubi omnes simul lavantur?\""

