    # a "\"Well, I want them to believe that I'm forward-thinking. Everyone else in the palace has this aura of traditionalism which is not something I'm aiming for.\""
    a "\"Bene, volo eos credere me in futura prospicere. Ceteri omnes in palatio quendam habitum veterum morum tenacem habent, quod ego non peto.\""

