    # "The wolf glides up to the edge of the pool with only half of his muzzle sticking up from the water, like an ominous, furry shark fin."
    "Lupus ad marginem piscinae natat, sola dimidia rostri parte super aquam eminente, quasi minax pilosaque squali pinna."

# game/a1s4.rpy:656
translate latin a1s4_e293a71b:

    # "I start to move back, but that's when Amicus suddenly rises out of the water, stepping onto an underwater bench along the edge of the pool that I hadn't seen."
    "Retrocedere incipio, sed tum Amicus subito ex aqua surgit, in scamnum sub aqua secundum marginem piscinae positum ascendens, quod non videram."

# game/a1s4.rpy:657
translate latin a1s4_bd6c2153:

    # "He wraps his arms around me, his hot, fur-plastered body squeezing against me for a moment, then squeezing even harder as he physically lifts me off the ground and falls back into he pool."
    "Bracchiis me amplectitur; corpus eius calidum pilis madidis adhaerentibus paulisper me premit, deinde etiam arctius, dum corpore suo me e solo tollit et retro in piscinam cadit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:658
