    "Breve tantum tempus habeo lupum repellere conandi, corpus eius magnum frustra impellens, antequam in aquam ferventem immergor."

# game/a1s4.rpy:661
translate latin a1s4_5836f85b:

    # "For a moment I wonder if I'm going to boil alive, but as soon as Amicus lets me go and my head breaks through the surface, I can already feel the sting wearing off into a pleasant warmth."
    "Paulisper quaero an vivus coquar, sed simul ac Amicus me dimittit et caput meum supra superficiem emergit, iam sentio ardorem mordacem in iucundum calorem mutari."

# game/a1s4.rpy:662
translate latin a1s4_cbdbc718:

