    "Amicus me neglegit, potius ad scamnum sub aqua positum sedendi causa accedens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:680
translate latin a1s4_a8c8d252:

    # "I do the same, sitting a foot away from the wolf, enveloping my face in the steam that rises off the water."
    "Idem facio, uno pede a lupo sedens, faciem vapore ex aqua ascendente involutam habens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:682
