    "Iam cum animum ipsi aquae sensui intendo, assentiri debeo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:684
translate latin a1s4_9a894c3b:

    # "The heat seems to seep through my skin and into the muscle, sending a pleasant shiver up my spine even though I'm completely warm."
    "Calor per cutem in musculos penetrare videtur, suavem tremorem sursum per spinam mittens, quamquam totus calidus sum."

# game/a1s4.rpy:685
translate latin a1s4_c806ebc0_3:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:689
translate latin a1s4_8bab2e90:

    # a "\"I need to do this more often. All of this official business nonsense is starting to weigh on my mental capacities.\""
    a "\"Saepius hoc facere debeo. Omnes hae nugae munerum officialium facultates animi mei gravare incipiunt.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:690
translate latin a1s4_bd43aaa3:

    # m "\"Is it really nonsense?\""
    m "\"Num vere nugae sunt?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:692
translate latin a1s4_7c6496dc:

    # a "\"For the most part, it really is. So much useless etiquette and protocol. Sometimes, I completely understand what it is Cassius dislikes about the current way of things.\""
    a "\"Plerumque sane sunt. Tot inutiles caerimoniae et protocolla. Interdum omnino intellego quid Cassio in praesenti rerum ratione displiceat.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:693
translate latin a1s4_60337858:

    # m "\"What way of things?\""
    m "\"Qua rerum ratione?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:694
translate latin a1s4_3e863184:

    # a "\"Oh, just the way politics work; never saying what we're actually thinking, using coded language. It slows things down...but I know that there's a reason for it. Keeps things civil and peaceful...mostly.\""
    a "\"O, tantum quomodo res politicae aguntur: numquam dicimus quid re vera cogitemus, tecte loquimur. Res tardat... sed scio causam esse. Res civiles et pacificas servat... plerumque.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:695
translate latin a1s4_b4e90e1f:

    # m "\"And Cassius would do away with that?\""
    m "\"Et Cassius haec tolleret?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:696
translate latin a1s4_73f13025:

    # a "\"He would do away with many things, current political protocol being one of them. It's one of the main reason's he's so popular.\""
    a "\"Multa tolleret, quorum unum praesens protocollum politicum est. Haec una e praecipuis causis est cur tam popularis sit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:697
translate latin a1s4_317d0c7b:

    # m "\"Well...you seem to kind of agree with it. Getting things done without all of that 'official business nonsense' in the way could be a good thing.\""
    m "\"Bene... tu quoque aliquantum consentire videris. Res perficere sine omnibus illis 'nugis munerum officialium' impedientibus bonum esse potest.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:698
translate latin a1s4_fea09bf9:

    # a "\"Hmmm...\""
    a "\"Hmmm...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:699
translate latin a1s4_f5d9c590:

    # "Amicus sinks lower into the water until it's up to his neck."
    "Amicus deorsum in aquam subsidit, donec aqua collum eius attingit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:701
translate latin a1s4_a35da99b:

    # a "\"Remember the story I just told you about Drusus and Meera?\""
    a "\"Meministi fabulae quam modo de Druso et Meera tibi narravi?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:702
translate latin a1s4_c806ebc0_4:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:703
translate latin a1s4_945ed514:

    # a "\"Well, whether that story is true or not, he was the one that started the way we do things to this day. Before him...well, we had a string of populist emperors, and the results were not great from what I've read.\""
    a "\"Bene, sive illa fabula vera est sive non, ille rationem instituit qua adhuc agimus. Ante eum... bene, complures deinceps imperatores populares habuimus, et exitus non boni erant, quantum legi.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:705
translate latin a1s4_27da80a7:

    # a "\"Honestly, I completely understand what it is that makes Cassius appealing to the people, and it's something that I sometimes want to do myself. The only thing holding me back is history.\""
    a "\"Re vera omnino intellego quid Cassium populo gratum reddat, atque interdum ipse idem facere cupio. Sola historia me retinet.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:706
translate latin a1s4_442e1cca:

    # a "\"Time and time again, whenever a leader like Cassius has come around, it only results in a weak, isolated empire.\""
    a "\"Iterum atque iterum, quotiens dux qualis Cassius apparuit, nihil nisi imperium infirmum et ab aliis seiunctum secutum est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:707
translate latin a1s4_acb8a614:

    # m "\"Well...from what little I've heard, isn't that how it is now?\""
    m "\"Bene... ex paucis quae audivi, nonne iam ita est?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:709
translate latin a1s4_856f4a12:

    # a "\"Well...yes, but that's because we've never fully transitioned into an outward-looking and outreaching empire. Drusus started it, but it's taken us 10,000 years to get here. It was much worse back then, and that's what Cassius wants to go back to.\""
    a "\"Bene... ita, sed id accidit quia numquam plene ad imperium externa spectans et ad alios accedens transivimus. Drusus incepit, sed 10,000 annos consumpsimus ut huc perveniremus. Tunc multo peius erat, et illuc Cassius redire vult.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:710
translate latin a1s4_8673bebd:

    # a "\"I intend to take some of the final steps so that we may join the other siblings on the journey to parenthood.\""
    a "\"Aliquot ex ultimis gradibus facere intendo, ut ceteris Fratribus in itinere ad Parentum gradum asciscamur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:711
translate latin a1s4_3110114f:

    # m "\"Oh, so that's the goal for everyone? To become a parent?\""
    m "\"O, ergo hoc omnibus propositum est? Parentem fieri?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:713
translate latin a1s4_87117f8f:

    # a "\"Yes, and to continue the spread of our culture beyond the galaxy.\""
    a "\"Ita, et cultum nostrum ultra galaxiam propagare pergere.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:714
translate latin a1s4_930e9976:

    # m "\"So what makes you a parent?\""
    m "\"Ergo quid te Parentem facit?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:716
translate latin a1s4_48a7832b:

    # a "\"When we can travel to other galaxies in a practical manner.\""
    a "\"Cum ad alias galaxias utili modo iter facere possumus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:717
translate latin a1s4_949cdda7:

    # m "\"Oh, so why not just use the Stretch Drive for that?\""
    m "\"O, cur ergo Propulsore Distensionis tantum ad id non utamini?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:719
translate latin a1s4_4ec7eed8:

    # a "\"It is not possible to harness enough power to use the Stretch Drive for such distances. The parents have a different method...but they haven't told us how, obviously.\""
    a "\"Non fieri potest ut satis energiae capiamus ad Propulsorem Distensionis tam longis itineribus adhibendum. Parentes aliam rationem habent... sed sane nondum nobis explicaverunt quomodo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:720
translate latin a1s4_e7d3e19a:

    # m "\"Hm, so are you close to doing it?\""
    m "\"Hm, ergo prope estis ut id facere possitis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:721
translate latin a1s4_0a09b737:

    # a "\"To intergalactic travel? No.\""
    a "\"Ad itinera inter galaxias? Non.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:722
translate latin a1s4_467c3434:

    # m "\"Is anyone?\""
    m "\"Aliquis est?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:723
translate latin a1s4_43e30296:

    # a "\"Well...there are rumors that the Khemians are on the verge of it. It wouldn't surprise me. It's assumed that they already know how to use their own Stretch Drive.\""
    a "\"Bene... rumores sunt Khemianos iam paene posse. Non me miraretur. Putantur iam scire quomodo proprio Propulsore Distensionis utantur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:724
translate latin a1s4_9c8298af:

    # "This talk about the Stretch Drive reminds me of something."
    "Hic sermo de Propulsore Distensionis aliquid mihi in memoriam revocat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:725
translate latin a1s4_0269ba3b:

    # m "\"Soooo, when I was out serving Cassius—\""
    m "\"Eeeergo, cum foris Cassio ministrabam—\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:727
translate latin a1s4_2c75fea3:

    # "Amicus growls softly in his throat as I remind him."
    "Amicus leniter in gutture ringitur, cum eum admoneo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:728
translate latin a1s4_4ef2d45e:

    # m "\"Well, they were talking about stuff, about the Stretch Drive depletion, or whatever.\""
    m "\"Bene, de rebus loquebantur, de energia Propulsoris Distensionis deficienti aut tale quid.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:730
translate latin a1s4_c8caa8fc:

    # a "\"Oh?\""
    a "\"O?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:731
translate latin a1s4_6c6857c4:

    # m "\"Yeah, so...apparently no one knows why your Parent stopped talking to you guys? And Virginia was saying that you might never leave the star system again?\""
    m "\"Ita, ergo... ut videtur, nemo scit cur Parens vester vobiscum loqui desierit? Et Virginia dicebat vos fortasse numquam rursus e systemate stellae exituros?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:733
translate latin a1s4_00c59d2c:

    # a "\"Oh...\""
    a "\"O...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:734
translate latin a1s4_7b219b50:

    # "I frown at him."
    "Frontem ad eum corrugo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:736
translate latin a1s4_817ed402:

    # a "\"Well that was rather presumptuous of her.\""
    a "\"Bene, satis temere id praesumpsit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:737
translate latin a1s4_f0f54c5a:

    # m "\"Is it true?\""
    m "\"Verum est?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:738
translate latin a1s4_b3688488:

    # a "\"Well, no. I mean sure, it doesn't happen often, but they stopped immediately after father's death. There's no other explanation than that our Parent knew that there would be issues with the emperorship.\""
    a "\"Bene, non. Scilicet, non saepe accidit, sed statim post patris mortem desierunt. Nulla alia explicatio est quam Parentem nostrum scivisse difficultates circa imperii successionem futuras esse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:739
translate latin a1s4_e5a48c34:

    # a "\"The Stretch and contact with our Parent will be re-established once I become emperor. I promise you that, [mc].\""
    a "\"Distensio et contactus cum Parente nostro restituentur cum imperator factus ero. Hoc tibi promitto, [mc].\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:740
translate latin a1s4_1e443686:

    # "Amicus says it with his usual confidence, but that doesn't settle the anxiety in my stomach."
    "Amicus solita confidentia dicit, sed anxietatem in ventre meo non sedat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:741
translate latin a1s4_a46bb0e7:

    # "I sigh in frustration, closing my eyes."
    "Frustratus suspiro, oculos claudens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:742
translate latin a1s4_daa06780:

    # m "\"Why is everything so complicated with you?\""
    m "\"Cur omnia tecum tam implicata sunt?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:744
translate latin a1s4_cc43205e:

    # a "\"What do you mean?\""
    a "\"Quid dicis?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:745
translate latin a1s4_c28ff094:

    # m "\"If you'd just tell me the actual truth about everything that's going on, I wouldn't feel like I'm being hit over the head with something new every other day.\""
    m "\"Si tantum verum de omnibus quae fiunt mihi diceres, non sentirem quasi alternis diebus nova aliqua re caput percussum haberem.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:747
translate latin a1s4_83a8bdbc:

    # a "\"[mc], stop worrying. I know things seem unsure, but it's only because of the precarious position our empire is in right now. Once I become emperor, things will settle and we will figure out how to get you home.\""
    a "\"[mc], desine sollicitari. Scio res incertas videri, sed id tantum ob precariam condicionem imperii nostri nunc fit. Cum imperator factus ero, res quiescent et inveniemus quomodo te domum reducamus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:748
translate latin a1s4_95342011:

    # "Amicus sets a paw on my shoulder and I turn to look at him, my expression probably still gloomy."
    "Amicus manum super umerum meum ponit; ad eum aspiciendum me verto, vultu meo adhuc probabiliter tristi."

# game/a1s4.rpy:750
translate latin a1s4_7af9e243:

    # a "\"I {i}will{/i} get you home, [mc]. That I promise. And even if the Stretch isn't immediately restored, I will find a way...even if it means making some sort of deal with another sibling...like the Khemians.\""
    a "\"Te domum {i}reducam{/i}, [mc]. Hoc promitto. Et, etsi Distensio non statim restituta erit, viam inveniam... etsi cum alio Fratre paciscendum sit... velut cum Khemianis.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:752
translate latin a1s4_b2682e3a:

    # "Amicus frowns at his last statement."
    "Amicus ad ultimam sententiam frontem corrugat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:753
translate latin a1s4_a44152a6:

    # "Still, that does set me at ease, and I place a hand on his paw."
    "Tamen hoc me sedat, et manum meam super eius manum pono."

# game/a1s4.rpy:754
translate latin a1s4_b98aafbc:

    # m "\"Thanks, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Gratias, Amice.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:756
translate latin a1s4_c6c7537d:

    # "Amicus's very serious mood dissipates and his ears come up as he smiles."
    "Animus Amici gravissimus remittitur; aures eius surgunt dum arridet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:757
translate latin a1s4_b371428f:

    # a "\"So you're feeling relaxed again? That is why we're here, you know.\""
    a "\"Ergo rursus relaxatus es? Ideo hic sumus, scis.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:758
translate latin a1s4_ad10a89a:

    # "I smile."
    "Arrideo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:759
translate latin a1s4_5973d811:

    # m "\"Yeah, I guess so.\""
    m "\"Ita, credo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:761
translate latin a1s4_969135f2:

    # a "\"Good!\""
    a "\"Bene!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:765
translate latin a1s4_5bcffcbc:

    # "We fall into a bit of a silence then, and I lean my head back against the ledge of the pool, letting the warmth take over my body."
    "Tum paulum tacemus; caput contra marginem piscinae reclino, sinens calorem totum corpus meum occupare."

# game/a1s4.rpy:766
translate latin a1s4_818ff141:

    # "It makes me feel heavy and tired, but good."
    "Gravem fessumque me reddit, sed bene me sentio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:767
translate latin a1s4_39e1dca1:

    # "My head slips off the ledge a few times as I doze off a bit, each time waking up before my head can go into the water."
    "Caput aliquotiens e margine labitur dum paulum dormito; singulis vicibus expergiscor antequam in aquam descendere possit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:768
translate latin a1s4_f0159b3b:

    # "Amicus notices the third time this happens."
    "Amicus tertia vice hoc animadvertit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:770
translate latin a1s4_14127b32:

    # a "\"Sleepy?\""
    a "\"Somniculosus es?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:771
translate latin a1s4_350d0126:

    # m "\"A little.\""
    m "\"Aliquantum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:773
translate latin a1s4_0d918ff5:

    # a "\"Lean against me so that you don't make the bottom of the pool your new bed.\""
    a "\"Mihi innitere, ne fundum piscinae novum lectum facias.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:774
translate latin a1s4_e9f1a195:

    # "I hesitate."
    "Haesito."

# game/a1s4.rpy:776
translate latin a1s4_f753ca79:

    # a "\"Don't worry. We already share the same bed.\""
    a "\"Noli sollicitus esse. Iam eundem lectum communicamus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:777
translate latin a1s4_557eb240:

    # "Amicus stretches an arm out over the ledge behind my head, not even looking at me as he does."
    "Amicus bracchium per marginem post caput meum extendit, ne me quidem aspiciens dum facit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:778
translate latin a1s4_cd1646fc:

    # "I get the weird feeling that I'm in a movie theater and my date just tried to casually rest his arm on the back of my chair."
    "Mirum sensum habeo quasi in cinematographo sim et is, quocum ad congressum amorosum veni, quasi fortuito bracchium in dorsum sedis meae imponere conatus sit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:779
translate latin a1s4_1ffe5142:

    # "But my head feels even heavier than the rest of my body, so I give in, letting it rest against Amicus's massive bicep and shoulder."
    "Sed caput etiam reliquo corpore gravius videtur; itaque cedo, sinens illud contra ingentem musculum bracchii umerumque Amici recumbere."

# game/a1s4.rpy:780
translate latin a1s4_8919adaa:

    # "I close my eyes, but then crack them open just a bit to look at Amicus."
    "Oculos claudo, deinde paulum aperio ut Amicum aspiciam."

# game/a1s4.rpy:782
translate latin a1s4_28d03967:

    # "He seems to be trying to stifle a smile."
    "Risum reprimere conari videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:783
translate latin a1s4_cde096a7:

    # "We've had a few moments like these."
    "Aliquot momenta talia habuimus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:784
translate latin a1s4_16616f09:

    # "At this point, I'm not sure if it's because he likes me, or because he sees me as some sort of actual pet, like a cat curling up in your lap."
    "Iam nescio an hoc fiat quia ei placeo, an quia me velut verum animal domesticum videt, sicut felem in gremio tuo convolutum."

# game/a1s4.rpy:785
translate latin a1s4_fa88abfd:

    # "I don't have much time to give it much though, because I start to fall asleep again."
    "Non multum temporis habeo rem cogitandi, quia rursus obdormire incipio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:786
translate latin a1s4_416733ad:

    # "I'm not sure how long I'm asleep, seconds or minutes, but that's when I hear the door open."
    "Nescio quam diu dormiam, secundasne an minuta, sed tum ianuam aperiri audio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:789
translate latin a1s4_1a2e98b5:

    # "It's not a loud sound, but Amicus jumps which makes me jump."
    "Sonus non magnus est, sed Amicus expavescit, quod me quoque expavescere facit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:790
translate latin a1s4_34c675a9:

    # "We both look toward the door."
    "Ambo ad ianuam respicimus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:792
translate latin a1s4_9a84da19:

    # "Neferu stands there, his eyes on us, that same smile on his face."
    "Ibi stat Neferu, nos intuens, eodem risu in vultu."

# game/a1s4.rpy:794
translate latin a1s4_9dccaa6f:

    # n "\"Oh, imagine running into you again today!\""
    n "\"O, quis putet me tibi hodie rursus occurrere!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:795
translate latin a1s4_5a2f57e6:

    # "Again, Neferu talks directly to me."
    "Iterum Neferu me ipsum alloquitur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:796
translate latin a1s4_4691012c:

    # "Without waiting for an answer, he strides in, paws busily tugging at his loincloth."
    "Responsum non exspectat, sed magnis passibus intrat, pedibus anterioribus sedulo subligaculum trahens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:798
translate latin a1s4_afa5e09e:

    # n "\"I'm sorry; I've come to the baths every day for the past week, but I've never encountered anyone.\""
    n "\"Ignosce; cotidie per proximam hebdomadem ad balnea veni, sed nemini umquam hic occurri.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:799
translate latin a1s4_07fe14e0:

    # "He strips off his loincloth, now only in his undergarments."
    "Subligaculum exuit et iam solis vestibus interioribus indutus est."

# game/a1s4.rpy:801
translate latin a1s4_6af1b0d7:

    # n "\"I was beginning to think it was never put to use.\""
    n "\"Iam putare incipiebam ea numquam usurpari.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:802
translate latin a1s4_679228fc:

    # "He starts to unwrap said undergarments."
    "Dictas vestes interiores solvere incipit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:804
translate latin a1s4_724da3c7:

    # n "\"I found that strange considering how incredibly relaxing the water is. It's such a great way to clear the mind and meditate.\""
    n "\"Id mirum mihi videbatur, cum aqua tam incredibiliter animum relaxet. Nihil fere aptius ad mentem purgandam et meditandum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:805
translate latin a1s4_4f894482:

    # "He unwraps his underwear, the cloth tied in a way that looked much more complicated than my own."
    "Vestes interiores solvit; pannus multo intricatius quam meus ligatus videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:807
translate latin a1s4_cb226146:

    # n "\"Not that I mind. I always enjoy good company and conversation.\""
    n "\"Non quod id mihi molestum sit. Semper bona societate et colloquio fruor.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:808
translate latin a1s4_5476c241:

    # "I have just enough time to notice the anatomical differences between Amicus and Neferu before I look away, feeling awkward staring at someone I barely know in the nude."
    "Vix tempus habeo ut corporum Amici et Neferu differentias animadvertam antequam oculos averto; incommodum mihi est hominem nudum, quem vix novi, fixis oculis intueri."

# game/a1s4.rpy:810
translate latin a1s4_f2b0afae:

    # "I'm not sure who he's talking to either, whether he's moved on from me to Amicus, or if he's still exclusively zeroed in on me."
    "Neque certo scio quem alloquatur: utrum, me relicto, ad Amicum se converterit, an adhuc solum me spectet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:811
translate latin a1s4_d6944ee6:

    # "Either way, Amicus answers while I stare at the steamy water."
    "Quidquid est, Amicus respondet, dum ego aquam vaporantem intueor."

# game/a1s4.rpy:813
translate latin a1s4_2bbb2161:

    # a "\"Erm...I see. I also enjoy the baths. It's just that we tend to be so busy these days.\""
    a "\"Em...intellego. Ego quoque balneis fruor. Sed his diebus plerumque tot negotiis occupamur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:814
translate latin a1s4_e08b7b6f:

    # n "\"Oh, I imagine.\""
    n "\"O, id facile credo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:815
translate latin a1s4_384e58d8:

    # "Neferu's voice gets closer behind me as he speaks, his soft footsteps barely audible."
    "Dum loquitur, vox Neferu post me propius accedit; leves eius passus vix audiri possunt."

# game/a1s4.rpy:816
translate latin a1s4_3a70bbe5:

    # n "\"Being adrift without an emperor can really hamper an empire.\""
    n "\"Sine imperatore incertis rebus iactari imperium magnopere impedire potest.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:817
translate latin a1s4_6d315c70:

    # "At this point, it sounds like Neferu is standing just over me, and I can only imagine what else is just over me."
    "Nunc ex voce videtur Neferu recta supra me stare, et tantum imaginari possum quid aliud recta supra me sit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:818
translate latin a1s4_935d281a:

    # "Amicus is craning his neck, looking up at the jackal."
    "Amicus collum extendit, chacalum suspiciens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:820
translate latin a1s4_d1480729:

    # a "\"Well, we DO have an emperor, just not the official one...yet.\""
    a "\"Bene, imperatorem QUIDEM habemus, modo nondum rite constitutum...adhuc.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:821
translate latin a1s4_e4456107:

    # n "\"Indeed.\""
    n "\"Certe.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:822
translate latin a1s4_9d49da51:

    # "I hear a soft splash next to me, and out of the corner of my eye, I see one of the jackal's legs dip into the water to stand on the bench, followed by the other."
    "Lenem aquae sonum iuxta me audio et ex extremo oculo video alterum chacali crus in aquam descendere ut in scamno stet, deinde alterum."

# game/a1s4.rpy:824
translate latin a1s4_9f6c08d9:

    # n "\"Ahh...that's nice. I took a rather long walk in the gardens today. It's left my paws rather sore. This is a welcome reprieve.\""
    n "\"Ahh...quam iucundum. Hodie satis diu per hortos ambulavi, quod pedes mihi satis dolentes reliquit. Grata haec requies est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:826
translate latin a1s4_8e3323ca:

    # a "\"Mmh.\""
    a "\"Mmh.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:827
translate latin a1s4_60d74ca8:

    # "Amicus grunts next to me, then actually pulls me in a bit with his arm."
    "Amicus iuxta me grunnit, deinde bracchio me etiam paulum propius trahit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:828
translate latin a1s4_7c899d2e:

    # "Neferu then gently hops off the bench to submerge himself up to his neck."
    "Tum Neferu leniter e scamno desilit, ut se usque ad collum immergat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:830
translate latin a1s4_c5d8b476:

    # "He lets out a soft, drawn out sigh, his eyes closed before he pulls himself up onto the bench...right next to me."
    "Oculis clausis lenem longumque suspirium emittit, deinde se in scamnum tollit...recta iuxta me."

# game/a1s4.rpy:831
translate latin a1s4_b7bb4496:

    # "Amicus lets out a sigh of his own, though this one is much shorter and very annoyed-sounding."
    "Amicus quoque suspirat, sed multo brevius et, ut sonus indicat, valde indignatus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:833
translate latin a1s4_442a8f8b:

    # n "\"We don't have baths like this in our palace. I might request one though, once I return home.\""
    n "\"In palatio nostro talia balnea non habemus. Fortasse tamen talia petam, cum domum rediero.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:834
translate latin a1s4_b924b287:

    # a "\"Mmh...\""
    a "\"Mmh...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:835
translate latin a1s4_0c570712:

    # "Again, Amicus barely responds, letting out a half-hearted grunt."
    "Rursus Amicus vix respondet, remisse grunniens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:836
translate latin a1s4_5479508b:

    # "At this point, the wolf has his arm completely around me, practically pulling me into his chest."
    "Iam lupus bracchio me totum amplectitur, paene in pectus suum trahens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:837
translate latin a1s4_163961b0:

    # "It's awkward, and we sit like that for a while, maybe about five minutes before Neferu finally speaks again."
    "Incommodum est, et ita aliquamdiu sedemus, fortasse quinque fere minuta, antequam Neferu tandem rursus loquitur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:839
translate latin a1s4_22316435:

    # n "\"So...how long have you been here, [mc]?\""
    n "\"Itaque...quamdiu hic fuisti, [mc]?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:840
translate latin a1s4_60fa7dbc:

    # "I give a start, then look up at Amicus."
    "Subsilio, deinde Amicum suspicio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:841
translate latin a1s4_d287726c:

    # "One of his eyes twitch, but he gives me a short nod."
    "Alter eius oculus tremit, sed breviter mihi annuit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:842
translate latin a1s4_66340e03:

    # m "\"Er...two...week.\""
    m "\"Em...duo...hebdomada.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:843
translate latin a1s4_07060bd9:

    # "Again, I have to hold my breath to stop myself from laughing at my caveman speak."
    "Iterum spiritum tenere debeo ne ob sermonem meum quasi hominis cavernarum rideam."

# game/a1s4.rpy:844
translate latin a1s4_471dfa5d:

    # "For some reason, it's incredibly hilarious even when the situation is totally serious."
    "Nescio cur incredibiliter ridiculum sit, etiam cum res omnino seria est."

# game/a1s4.rpy:846
translate latin a1s4_3434b011:

    # n "\"Hm...so you need permission to speak to me? I did not know that you were so strict with your slaves, Amicus.\""
    n "\"Hm...itaque tibi venia opus est ut mecum loquaris? Nesciebam te tam severe cum servis tuis agere, Amice.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:848
translate latin a1s4_937133d4:

    # "Amicus coughs in surprise."
    "Amicus prae admiratione tussit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:850
translate latin a1s4_03bbb3a8:

    # a "\"He's my pet, not a slave.\""
    a "\"Animal meum domesticum est, non servus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:852
translate latin a1s4_cc5d58e8:

    # n "\"Oh? Maybe it's a Lingua issue, but from what I've seen, there's very little difference. You do enslave your children after all, no?\""
    n "\"O? Fortasse Lingua vitium facit, sed ex iis quae vidi perparum interest. Liberos vestros tamen in servitutem redigitis, nonne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:854
translate latin a1s4_cb1afe5a:

    # "Amicus is quiet for a moment, and I look back up at him to see him staring at the jackal, his mouth open."
    "Amicus paulisper tacet; eum rursus suspicio et video eum ore aperto chacalum intuentem."

# game/a1s4.rpy:856
translate latin a1s4_cbb4a3f9:

    # n "\"Are you alright?\""
    n "\"Bene vales?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:858
translate latin a1s4_17f383a1:

    # a "\"Excuse me, but I'm finding your questions a bit pointed.\""
    a "\"Ignosce, sed quaestiones tuas aliquantum aculeatas invenio.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:860
translate latin a1s4_e5898b88:

    # n "\"Oh, I'm sorry. I've been told our way of speaking can be a bit blunt by your standards. But consider that the topic of slavery is simply always pointed.\""
    n "\"O, ignosce. Mihi dictum est morem nostrum loquendi vestris iudiciis paulo directiorem videri posse. Sed cogita ipsam servitutis quaestionem semper aculeatam esse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:862
translate latin a1s4_3d297cbb:

    # a "\"Well, why don't we move to a less pointed topic, then?\""
    a "\"Bene, cur igitur ad rem minus aculeatam non transeamus?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:864
translate latin a1s4_bcc96cce:

    # n "\"Of course! So, [mc], what is your species? I must say that I've never seen your kind before.\""
    n "\"Profecto! Ita, [mc], cuius generis es? Fateor me tuum genus numquam antea vidisse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:865
translate latin a1s4_3918255d:

    # "Amicus's arm tightens around my shoulder again, but he doesn't say anything, staring straight ahead at the other side of the pool."
    "Bracchium Amici rursus circa umerum meum stringitur, sed nihil dicit, alteram piscinae partem recta intuens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:866
translate latin a1s4_1b75af47:

    # m "\"Uh...Simian...\""
    m "\"Em...Simius...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:868
translate latin a1s4_399ffbea:

    # "Neferu chuckles next to me."
    "Neferu iuxta me subridet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:870
translate latin a1s4_b482dcdc:

    # n "\"You know, you don't have to speak in such a simple way to me. I already know that you can converse well enough.\""
    n "\"Scis, non necesse est ut tam simpliciter mecum loquaris. Iam scio te satis bene colloqui posse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:871
translate latin a1s4_5060ba17:

    # "I stiffen up, but Amicus jumps in for me."
    "Rigesco, sed Amicus pro me statim loquitur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:873
translate latin a1s4_05eb11ec:

    # a "\"What are you talking about, jackal?\""
    a "\"De quo loqueris, chacale?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:875
translate latin a1s4_1a406e64:

    # n "\"Oh, are we already jumping to informal language? Well, I'm simply referring to his intelligence, {i}wolf{/i}. I'm confused as to why he's downplaying it for me.\""
    n "\"O, iam ad sermonem familiarem transimus? Bene, de intelligentia eius tantum loquor, {i}lupe{/i}. Non intellego cur eam mihi minorem fingat.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:877
translate latin a1s4_13064d61:

    # a "\"Well, I don't know how you know anything about him. Come [mc], let's head back to my room.\""
    a "\"Bene, nescio quomodo quicquam de eo scias. Veni, [mc], ad cubiculum meum redeamus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:878
translate latin a1s4_6509532b:

    # "Amicus stands and pulls me up, but Neferu stands with us, reaching out for one of the white towels."
    "Amicus surgit et me tollit, sed Neferu nobiscum surgit, manum ad unum e linteis albis porrigens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:882
translate latin a1s4_1a5e43e5:

    # n "\"That is why I'm trying to make conversation with him, but if he needs your permission to do anything, including speak, then maybe I should leave your slave alone?\""
    n "\"Ideo cum eo colloqui conor, sed si ad quidlibet faciendum, etiam ad loquendum, tua venia eget, fortasse servum tuum solum relinquere debeam?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:883
translate latin a1s4_d5184a07:

    # "Amicus turns on the Khemian, not bothering to hide his anger anymore."
    "Amicus ad Khemianum se vertit, iram suam iam celare non curans."

# game/a1s4.rpy:885
translate latin a1s4_6fe8f72d:

    # a "\"He is NOT a slave. Please refrain from calling him as such.\""
    a "\"Servus NON est. Quaeso ne eum ita appelles.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:887
translate latin a1s4_1e3820cc:

    # n "\"If he isn't, then he should be able to speak freely.\""
    n "\"Si non est, libere loqui posse debet.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:889
translate latin a1s4_a4836dae:

    # a "\"He is able to speak freely, jackal.\""
    a "\"Libere loqui potest, chacale.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:891
translate latin a1s4_f3e93de5:

    # n "\"Then I have to wonder why he asks your permission AND stupefies his speech. It's all a bit odd, isn't it?\""
    n "\"Tum mirari debeo cur veniam tuam petat ET sermonem suum stultum reddat. Haec omnia aliquantum mira sunt, nonne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:892
translate latin a1s4_b5943e7b:

    # a "\"Again, I don't know how you know anything about him.\""
    a "\"Iterum dico me nescire quomodo quicquam de eo scias.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:894
translate latin a1s4_5779fb3b:

    # n "\"Alex told me.\""
    n "\"Alex mihi dixit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:896
translate latin a1s4_8c0c1321:

    # "The jackal grins and I note that he's using Alex's shortened name."
    "Chacalus late ridet, et animadverto eum breviore Alex nomine uti."

# game/a1s4.rpy:897
translate latin a1s4_a07e5ee9:

    # "Amicus stares in surprise."
    "Amicus stupens intuetur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:899
translate latin a1s4_8d1c94a4:

    # n "\"So don't worry, [mc], you can speak without worrying about what I might learn.\""
    n "\"Ita ne time, [mc]; loqui potes sine metu eorum quae discere possim.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:900
translate latin a1s4_a0da3132:

    # "Neferu sets a paw on my shoulder, and Amicus's hackles raise."
    "Neferu pedem anteriorem in umero meo ponit, et pili cervicis Amici eriguntur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:902
translate latin a1s4_cb07fca2:

    # "Gently but firmly, he reaches out to move Neferu's paw off my shoulder."
    "Amicus leniter sed firmiter manum porrigit ut pedem Neferu de umero meo removeat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:903
translate latin a1s4_5cc09076:

    # a "\"Please, do not touch my pet.\""
    a "\"Quaeso, animal meum domesticum ne tangas.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:905
translate latin a1s4_6a846056:

    # n "\"Oh...so he needs permission to be touched as well?\""
    n "\"O...itaque venia etiam eget ut tangatur?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:906
translate latin a1s4_6483efd6:

    # "Amicus steps sideways, partially blocking me from the jackal's view."
    "Amicus ad latus gradum facit, me ex parte a conspectu chacali occultans."

# game/a1s4.rpy:907
translate latin a1s4_245992c3:

    # a "\"What is your concern with him, Neferu?\""
    a "\"Quid tibi cum eo est, Neferu?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:909
translate latin a1s4_e01c93e8:

    # n "\"I'm simply interested in intelligent species that I've never seen before, and well—\""
    n "\"Genera intellegentia, quae numquam antea vidi, me tantum alliciunt, et, bene...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:910
translate latin a1s4_58dc9d8f:

    # "Neferu reaches out over Amicus's shoulder, touching my hair and rubbing it between two finger pads, similar to what Amicus sometimes does."
    "Neferu super umerum Amici manum porrigit, capillos meos tangit et inter duorum digitorum pulvinulos terit, fere ut Amicus interdum facit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:911
translate latin a1s4_0ccb454d:

    # n "\"He is a fascinating lookin—ng!\""
    n "\"Aspectu sane admira...ng!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:914
translate latin a1s4_9cddbe1d:

    # "I start to move my head away, but before I know it, Amicus has Neferu shoved up against the wall, one paw on his chest, glaring into his face."
    "Caput avertere incipio, sed antequam quid fiat intellego, Amicus Neferu ad parietem impellit atque ibi tenet, altero pede anteriore in pectore eius posito, vultum eius iratis oculis intuens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:915
translate latin a1s4_2fb0032a:

    # a "\"I said not to touch him.\""
    a "\"Dixi ne eum tangeres.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:916
translate latin a1s4_c8cb8f0d:

    # "His voice is low, almost too quiet for me to hear."
    "Vox eius gravis est, paene tam submissa ut eam audire non possim."

# game/a1s4.rpy:917
translate latin a1s4_0ea5548e:

    # "I want to jump in somehow, maybe push Amicus toward the door so we can just leave and not cause an interstellar incident, but they're both so big and intimidating..."
    "Quoquo modo intervenire volo, fortasse Amicum ad ianuam impellere, ut discedere possimus nec rem inter stellas gravem movere; sed ambo tam magni sunt et terrorem iniciunt..."

# game/a1s4.rpy:918
translate latin a1s4_6c270c8a:

    # n "\"Oh right, sorry. I keep forgetting that he's not a slave with the way you treat him, needing your permission for everything.\""
    n "\"O, recte, ignosce. Semper obliviscor eum servum non esse, cum ita eum tractes ut ad omnia tua venia egeat.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:919
translate latin a1s4_415b7862:

    # a "\"He doesn't.\""
    a "\"Non eget.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:920
translate latin a1s4_ce5224fb:

    # "I step forward then."
    "Tum procedo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:921
translate latin a1s4_59ca6d19:

    # m "\"Well, you need {i}my{/i} permission.\""
    m "\"Bene, {i}mea{/i} venia tibi opus est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:922
translate latin a1s4_83c709b6:

    # "The statement just sort of slips out of my mouth, my irritation with the jackal growing along with Amicus's."
    "Verba mihi quasi sua sponte excidunt, indignatione mea adversus chacalum una cum Amici indignatione crescente."

# game/a1s4.rpy:923
translate latin a1s4_03f8e2b6:

    # "Neferu's eyes widen for just a moment before his smile returns."
    "Oculi Neferu brevissimo tempore dilatantur antequam risus eius redit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:924
translate latin a1s4_88fa4f65:

    # n "\"Ah, so it is true...I knew I saw intelligence in those eyes.\""
    n "\"Ah, verum igitur est...sciebam me intelligentiam in illis oculis vidisse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:925
translate latin a1s4_58dd2e53:

    # "Despite having a canine that's a good deal larger than him pinning him to the wall, Neferu seems quite calm."
    "Quamquam canis eo multo maior eum ad parietem tenet, Neferu satis tranquillus videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:926
translate latin a1s4_d028744b:

    # a "\"You know nothing of the way I treat him. And please do not call him a slave again; it is an affront to his actual status.\""
    a "\"Nihil scis de modo quo eum tracto. Et quaeso ne eum rursus servum appelles; id vero eius statui iniuriam facit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:927
translate latin a1s4_de629e25:

    # n "\"Again, my apologies.\""
    n "\"Iterum veniam peto.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:928
translate latin a1s4_6cc60c45:

    # "He looks at me."
    "Me intuetur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:929
translate latin a1s4_f9b1b6f1:

    # n "\"May I touch you in a friendly manner in the future? A paw on the shoulder, an embrace even? Khemians are always physically intimate.\""
    n "\"Licetne mihi te posthac amice tangere? Pedem in umero ponere, etiam amplecti? Khemiani semper corporibus familiariter inter se agunt.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:930
translate latin a1s4_e3a5312e:

    # "I stare at him."
    "Eum fixis oculis intueor."

# game/a1s4.rpy:931
translate latin a1s4_3e3499eb:

    # m "\"...No.\""
    m "\"...Non.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:932
translate latin a1s4_820cc30d:

    # "Amicus snorts with satisfaction, blowing back some fur on Neferu's face."
    "Amicus contentus per nares flat, quosdam pilos in Neferu vultu retro impellens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:933
translate latin a1s4_c76be7d0:

    # a "\"Now, kindly leave my pet alone in the future. He's very busy.\""
    a "\"Nunc, quaeso, animal meum domesticum posthac solum relinque. Multis negotiis occupatur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:934
translate latin a1s4_e68bcb69:

    # n "\"Again, this language that implies that you own him. It's confusing to me.\""
    n "\"Rursus hic sermo te eius dominum esse significans. Id me confundit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:935
translate latin a1s4_57602912:

    # "Amicus growls, but Neferu doesn't seem to notice the warning."
    "Amicus fremit, sed Neferu monitionem animadvertere non videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:936
translate latin a1s4_b36ba3e4:

    # n "\"I suppose it's only natural for a slave-driving race such as your own. You believe you own everything and everyone lower on the hierarchy.\""
    n "\"Credo id naturale esse genti servos exercenti, qualis vestra est. Omnia et omnes qui in ordine dignitatum infra vos sunt vestram possessionem esse creditis.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:937
translate latin a1s4_85c8ef2b:

    # "Amicus's eyes widen, nostrils flaring."
    "Oculi Amici dilatantur et nares eius expanduntur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:939
translate latin a1s4_760739c1:

    # a "\"WHAT!? I'll have you know that they are servants, and I do plan to change—nevermind, it is not your place to criticize my empire!\""
    a "\"QUID!? Scito eos famulos esse, et mihi quidem propositum est mutare...nihil refert; non est tuum imperium meum vituperare!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:940
translate latin a1s4_001dd194:

    # "Neferu seems to take some interest in what Amicus just said, pausing for only a moment before speaking again."
    "Quod Amicus modo dixit aliquantum Neferu allicere videtur; paulisper tantum moratur antequam rursus loquitur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:941
translate latin a1s4_6784af14:

    # n "\"Your empire? Didn't you say someone else was acting as the emperor?\""
    n "\"Imperium tuum? Nonne alium imperatoris munere fungi dixisti?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:942
translate latin a1s4_fbbfee91:

    # a "\"The empire belongs to all wolves, but I'll have you know that I WILL become the emperor, jackal, and keeping that in mind, you should learn to hold your tongue if you want to establish an alliance!\""
    a "\"Imperium omnium luporum est, sed scito me CERTE imperatorem futurum esse, chacale; id in mente habens, linguam continere discere debes si societatem constituere vis!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:943
translate latin a1s4_55749bb7:

    # n "\"Ah, but does the empire belong to the 'servants' that mine your natural resources across the dozens of planets in our galaxy?\""
    n "\"Ah, sed estne imperium etiam illorum 'famulorum' qui opes naturales vestras ex multis decenis planetarum Galaxiae nostrae effodiunt?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:944
translate latin a1s4_0a87c95e:

    # a "\"What is your issue with me? Or are you this rude to everyone you meet?\""
    a "\"Quid contra me habes? An tam inurbanus es omnibus quibus occurris?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:945
translate latin a1s4_71e4c7f8:

    # "The jackal is quiet and Amicus just growls at him, waiting for an answer."
    "Chacalus tacet, et Amicus tantum adversus eum fremit, responsum exspectans."

# game/a1s4.rpy:946
translate latin a1s4_649e4b6d:

    # "That's when I realize that Neferu isn't even looking at Amicus's face, he's looking at..."
    "Tum intellego Neferu ne vultum quidem Amici intueri, sed..."

# game/a1s4.rpy:947
translate latin a1s4_ae2977cd:

    # "And now that I'm looking at {i}it{/i}, I realize that it's looking a bit bigger than usual."
    "Et nunc, dum {i}illud{/i} intueor, intellego id aliquantum maius quam solet videri."

# game/a1s4.rpy:948
translate latin a1s4_e1c87b4e:

    # n "\"You know, I heard rumors that the emperor's son was a tail-raiser, but honestly, I wasn't expecting you to use this moment as an opportunity. Did you simply want to get your paws on me?\""
    n "\"Scis, rumores audivi imperatoris filium caudam attollere, sed, ut verum dicam, non exspectabam te hanc occasionem arripere. Tantumne manus in me inicere cupiebas?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:951
translate latin a1s4_2abf8404:

    # "In one smooth, fluid motion, Neferu spins into Amicus, thumping his back into the other canine's front, making the big wolf grunt and puff air into the top of Neferu's head with an {i}oof{/i} sound."
    "Uno motu levi ac fluido Neferu se in Amicum convertit, dorsum suum in alterius canis partem anteriorem impellens; magnus lupus grunnit et spiritum in summum caput Neferu cum sono {i}uff{/i} emittit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:952
translate latin a1s4_a49742f9:

    # "Neferu leans there against the wolf, holding onto his big paw while the other comes up to tease at Amicus's chin."
    "Neferu ibi lupo innititur, magnum eius pedem anteriorem tenens, dum alterum suum ad mentum Amici ludo tangendum tollit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:953
translate latin a1s4_a8619fd7:

    # "Amicus looks surprised, but he doesn't do anything to push the jackal away."
    "Amicus attonitus videtur, sed nihil facit ut chacalum repellat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:954
translate latin a1s4_d1e45a1a:

    # "Meanwhile, the jackal's rear pushes firmly up against Amicus's crotch..."
    "Interea nates chacali firmiter in inguen Amici premuntur..."

# game/a1s4.rpy:955
translate latin a1s4_7c0b2103:

    # "Amicus seems frozen, staring down at the jackal."
    "Amicus quasi riget, chacalum desuper fixis oculis intuens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:956
translate latin a1s4_9e4e313d:

    # "From what little I learned about Adastran slang on the TV, Neferu had just implied that Amicus is gay."
    "Ex paucis quae de sermone vulgari Adastrae per televisorium didici, Neferu modo significavit Amicum viros amare."

# game/a1s4.rpy:957
translate latin a1s4_080a0486:

    # n "\"If you were interested, you only had to ask. I know that Wolven ways of flirting are rather aggressive, and even though we jackals do things differently, I can adjust.\""
    n "\"Si me cupiebas, tantum rogare debebas. Scio Lupos satis violenter amori studere, et quamquam nos chacali aliter agimus, me accommodare possum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:958
translate latin a1s4_ed873959:

    # "At that, Amicus glares and roughly pushes Neferu away, sending the jackal to stumble against the wall."
    "Hoc audito, Amicus iratis oculis intuetur et Neferu aspere repellit, ita ut chacalus titubans ad parietem offendat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:960
translate latin a1s4_fea3def6:

    # "He turns around swiftly, his grin still in place."
    "Neferu celeriter se convertit, eodem adhuc risu in vultu."

# game/a1s4.rpy:962
translate latin a1s4_4ec5e95f:

    # n "\"Oh, did I get the wrong idea? I just assumed after you groped my chest and became excited.\""
    n "\"O, rem perperam intellexi? Tantum ita putavi postquam pectus meum palpasti et concitatus es.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:963
translate latin a1s4_08b117f8:

    # "Neferu gestures down at Amicus's crotch, the wolf's erect cock still waving around a bit after the jackal had spun away."
    "Neferu inguen Amici demonstrat; mentula erecta lupi adhuc paulum agitatur postquam chacalus se ab eo convertit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:964
translate latin a1s4_f46b81d9:

    # "Immediately, Amicus covers himself with both paws, glaring."
    "Statim Amicus ambobus pedibus anterioribus se tegit, iratis oculis intuens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:966
translate latin a1s4_6ad44ac0:

    # a "\"I...did not! And you were the one to touch my pet without his permission!\""
    a "\"Ego...non feci! Et tu ipse animal meum domesticum sine eius venia tetigisti!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:968
translate latin a1s4_cf314471:

    # "Amicus looks around for his underwear, snatching it up and beginning to tie it on."
    "Amicus vestes suas interiores quaerit, eas arripit et sibi alligare incipit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:969
translate latin a1s4_acb4cca7:

    # "I quickly grab a towel and my robes, feeling completely confused as to what the hell just happened."
    "Linteum et tunicas meas celeriter capio, prorsus confusus quid malum modo acciderit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:971
translate latin a1s4_343e2e0e:

    # n "\"Again, I thought he was your slave. But you're right. I should have asked for his permission. His fur was simply mesmerizing, so I forgot myself for a moment.\""
    n "\"Iterum, putabam eum servum tuum esse. Sed recte dicis. Veniam eius petere debebam. Pili eius me ita fascinaverunt ut paulisper mei oblitus sim.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:972
translate latin a1s4_623adabc:

    # "Neferu turns to me and bows."
    "Neferu ad me se vertit et inclinat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:974
translate latin a1s4_4c8221cf:

    # n "\"Good day, [mc]. I wish you luck in relieving your master's carnal desires.\""
    n "\"Bonum diem, [mc]. Bene tibi succedat in cupidinibus carnalibus domini tui sedandis.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:975
translate latin a1s4_7e1492e3:

    # "Neferu gestures at the fumbling wolf as he tries to tie on his underwear correctly."
    "Neferu lupum haesitantem demonstrat, dum ille vestes interiores recte alligare conatur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:977
translate latin a1s4_2bec69f4:

    # n "\"And to you, Amicus. Again, if you're interested, you only need to let me know.\""
    n "\"Et tibi, Amice. Iterum, si me cupis, tantum mihi significare debes.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:979
translate latin a1s4_80a77702:

    # a "\"Are you joking with me—\""
    a "\"Mecumne iocaris...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:981
translate latin a1s4_186472ef:

    # "Neferu is already striding off, grabbing up his own underwear and loincloth as he does, not even finished tying it on by the time he's walking out the door."
    "Iam Neferu magnis passibus discedit, simul vestes suas interiores et subligaculum colligens; cum ianuam transit, ne alligando quidem finem fecit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:982
translate latin a1s4_c2104c77:

    # "We both stand there in silence for a bit, staring as the door slides shut."
    "Ambo ibi paulisper taciti stamus, ianuam delabentem donec claudatur fixis oculis intuentes."

# game/a1s4.rpy:984
translate latin a1s4_8d2d63af:

    # "Then Amicus grabs up the rest of his clothes with a growl, turning to me."
    "Tum Amicus fremens ceteras vestes suas arripit et ad me se vertit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:985
translate latin a1s4_b259e837:

    # a "\"You alright?\""
    a "\"Valesne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:986
translate latin a1s4_2c7a45ad:

    # m "\"Uh, yeah, of course. What—\""
    m "\"Em, ita, sane. Quid...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:988
translate latin a1s4_b838aa60:

    # a "\"Come on.\""
    a "\"Veni.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:991
translate latin a1s4_eddec5df:

    # "And then Amicus is walking off even faster than Neferu had."
    "Tum Amicus discedit, etiam celerius quam Neferu."

# game/a1s4.rpy:992
translate latin a1s4_bd9bc37b:

    # "I quickly follow, not bothering to put on my robe since I'm still pretty wet."
    "Celeriter eum sequor, tunicam induere non curans, cum adhuc satis madidus sim."

# game/a1s4.rpy:995
translate latin a1s4_c37a2a52:

    # "We walk down the hall, Amicus muttering under his breath the whole time."
    "Per porticum ambulamus, Amico totum tempus submissa voce murmurante."

# game/a1s4.rpy:996
translate latin a1s4_d3ecebe4:

    # a "\"Unbelievable, UNBELIEVABLE! How would he have the nerve...arrogant Khemian ass...\""
    a "\"Incredibile, INCREDIBILE! Quomodo ausus sit...superbus Khemianus stultus...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:997
translate latin a1s4_b45aaaf5:

    # "As we make our way toward Amicus's room, I go over what just happened in my head."
    "Dum ad cubiculum Amici imus, quae modo acciderunt mente repeto."

# game/a1s4.rpy:998
translate latin a1s4_d459d70c:

    # "It seemed Neferu was making some kind of point about slavery, while at the same time taking that strange interest in me."
    "Neferu aliquid de servitute ostendere velle videbatur, simul illo miro studio in me incensus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:999
translate latin a1s4_73ccaa24:

    # "On top of that, the obvious sexual tension between the two of them was really odd, especially the way Amicus just stood there and let Neferu rub up against him while he was clearly hard."
    "Praeterea manifesta libido inter eos duos sane mira erat, praesertim quod Amicus ibi tantum stetit et Neferu sibi affricari passus est, dum ipse manifeste erectam mentulam habebat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1000
translate latin a1s4_802c18f8:

    # "Is this just how these aliens hit on each other, with all that bizarre, macho aggression?"
    "Estne hic simpliciter modus quo isti alieni amorem inter se petunt, cum illa tota mira violentia virili?"

# game/a1s4.rpy:1001
translate latin a1s4_ae48c76e:

    # "If it is, then I don't like it, but that doesn't matter; I'm not here for that kind of stuff anyway."
    "Si ita est, mihi non placet, sed nihil refert; non huiusmodi rerum causa hic sum."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1002
translate latin a1s4_f8e56ff0:

    # "I just need to get home..."
    "Mihi tantum domum redire opus est..."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1003
translate latin a1s4_4fe627f7:

    # "But at the same time, there's a little spark of jealousy in my chest at the thought of Amicus being interested in Neferu."
    "Sed simul parva aemulationis scintilla in pectore meo nascitur, cum cogito Amicum Neferu cupere."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1004
translate latin a1s4_b93e3dad:

    # "I don't know why, but the way he'd treated me at the pool almost seemed like flirting itself."
    "Nescio cur, sed modus quo apud piscinam mecum egit paene ipse amoris petitio videbatur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1005
translate latin a1s4_f57ed599:

    # "And then to immediately have eyes for Neferu..."
    "Et tum statim oculos ad Neferu vertere..."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1008
translate latin a1s4_8b01fdc3:

    # "As we walk into Amicus's room, I can't help myself—"
    "Cum cubiculum Amici intramus, me continere non possum..."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1009
translate latin a1s4_14711da9:

    # m "\"So is that the Wolven way of flirting?\""
    m "\"Ita hic est mos quo Lupi amorem petunt?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1010
translate latin a1s4_e1890503:

    # "I ask it casually, trying to act like I don't mind."
    "Quasi neglegenter rogo, simulare conans me non curare."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1013
translate latin a1s4_4327a965:

    # a "\"What? Definitely not! That damned jackal was assuming quite a lot!\""
    a "\"Quid? Minime vero! Damnatus ille chacalus nimis multa coniciebat!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1014
translate latin a1s4_662da30f:

    # m "\"I mean...\""
    m "\"Hoc volo dicere...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1015
translate latin a1s4_7757ae95:

    # "I feel myself blush."
    "Me rubescere sentio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1016
translate latin a1s4_38396c4b:

    # m "\"You were getting kinda hard while you had him pinned against the wall.\""
    m "\"Mentula tibi aliquantum erigebatur dum eum ad parietem premebas.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1018
translate latin a1s4_f405a8d1:

    # a "\"I—\""
    a "\"Ego—\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1019
translate latin a1s4_6d2fc16d:

    # m "\"I mean, I'm not offended or anything. I'm just curious about the culture, if that's how you guys go about things here.\""
    m "\"Hoc volo dicere: non offensus sum nec quicquam tale. Tantum de moribus curiosus sum, si vos hic ita agitis.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1020
translate latin a1s4_4ee0e210:

    # "Amicus sighs heavily."
    "Amicus graviter suspirat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1022
translate latin a1s4_2eb1a9f5:

    # a "\"I suppose wolves have a reputation for being...aggressive when it comes to courting a mate, but those days are long gone. The jackal was simply relying on dated stereotypes.\""
    a "\"Credo lupos famam habere...violentos esse cum consortis amorem petunt, sed illi dies iam diu praeterierunt. Chacalus tantum veteribus opinionibus vulgatis utebatur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1023
translate latin a1s4_1f228d29:

    # m "\"Okay.\""
    m "\"Bene.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1024
translate latin a1s4_291d440d:

    # "I adjust my robe a bit, the cold air of the room seeping through my still-wet underwear."
    "Tunicam paulum compono, dum frigidus cubiculi aer per vestes meas interiores adhuc madidas penetrat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1025
translate latin a1s4_c81ad304:

    # m "\"Not to pry too much, but are you gay? Neferu seemed to imply that.\""
    m "\"Nolo nimis curiosus esse, sed virosne amas? Neferu id significare videbatur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1027
translate latin a1s4_9c8394d8:

    # "Amicus freezes, staring at me."
    "Amicus riget, me fixis oculis intuens."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1028
translate latin a1s4_2125f52b:

    # "He doesn't seem to know what to tell me, like he's afraid of what my reaction might be."
    "Quid mihi dicat nescire videtur, quasi timeat quomodo respondeam."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1029
translate latin a1s4_c100c8a0:

    # "I remember then how stigmatized homosexuality is here."
    "Tum memini quam infamis amor eiusdem sexus hic habeatur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1030
translate latin a1s4_cb4dfb56:

    # "Homophobic slurs are used a lot in the films I've seen, including \"tail-raiser\" and \"cock-licker\"."
    "In pelliculis quas vidi multae contumeliae adversus eiusdem sexus amantes dicuntur, inter quas \"caudam attollens\" et \"mentulas lingens\"."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1031
translate latin a1s4_89cbeb64:

    # "It's weird because males seem to be pretty intimate with each other, kissing and holding paws being common between close friends."
    "Mirum est, quod mares inter se satis familiares videntur: oscula et pedes anteriores iuncti inter amicos intimos usitata sunt."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1032
translate latin a1s4_6e579ea0:

    # "However, there are lines that aren't crossed, and ACTUALLY being gay was looked down upon, which is what Neferu accused Amicus of being."
    "Tamen sunt fines quos non transeunt, et viros RE VERA amare contemptui erat, quod Neferu Amico crimini dedit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1033
translate latin a1s4_72f30bcf:

    # "I quickly try to reassure him."
    "Celeriter eum confirmare conor."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1034
translate latin a1s4_d4a33349:

    # m "\"You know, it's a fairly accepted thing on Earth these days. And I have no issue with it. If you are, you can tell me.\""
    m "\"Scis, id his diebus in Terra satis receptum est. Nec mihi quicquam contra id est. Si ita amas, mihi dicere potes.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1035
translate latin a1s4_aa5b1ef6:

    # "Amicus goes on staring at me for a little while longer, then sighs."
    "Amicus me paulo diutius fixis oculis intueri pergit, deinde suspirat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1037
translate latin a1s4_2358a584:

    # a "\"I...have a preference for males, yes.\""
    a "\"Ego...mares praefero, ita.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1038
translate latin a1s4_dbe2487d:

    # "He winces right after saying that."
    "Statim postquam id dixit, vultum contrahit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1039
translate latin a1s4_f125c56c:

    # m "\"Hey it's fine. Like I said, it's pretty well-accepted in a lot of places on Earth. But it explains why you were...getting hard in front of Neferu.\""
    m "\"Heus, bene est. Ut dixi, multis in locis Terrae satis bene recipitur. Sed explicat cur tibi...mentula coram Neferu erigeretur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1041
translate latin a1s4_0f1a228e:

    # a "\"I—Listen, it wasn't what I was intending when I first grabbed him. I was trying to defend you.\""
    a "\"Ego...Audi, non id propositum mihi erat cum primum eum cepi. Te defendere conabar.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1042
translate latin a1s4_31b4dc38:

    # m "\"Ah...I see.\""
    m "\"Ah...intellego.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1043
translate latin a1s4_9275f0ae:

    # "Amicus blushes all over again."
    "Amicus rursus rubescit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1045
translate latin a1s4_02fecd16:

    # "The wolf turns away and walks over to the sofa before slumping into it, leaning his face into a paw, looking frustrated."
    "Lupus se avertit et ad lectum sedendi ambulat, deinde in eum labitur, vultum pede anteriore sustentans, vexatus ut videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1046
translate latin a1s4_3c6a4d52:

    # m "\"What's wrong?\""
    m "\"Quid mali est?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1047
translate latin a1s4_f949365d:

    # a "\"Well, that jackal for one...and, I don't know. Are you disgusted with me now?\""
    a "\"Bene, primum ille chacalus...et nescio. Me iam fastidisne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1048
translate latin a1s4_d8a2e27c:

    # m "\"Why would I be disgusted with you?\""
    m "\"Cur te fastidiam?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1049
translate latin a1s4_dc1ee201:

    # a "\"I don't know...you must see past incidences in a different light, like the massages and wrestling...and the dance. I promise those are truly pet duties, and I was only having a bit of fun at the amphitheater...and I only did what the dance called fo—\""
    a "\"Nescio...res ante gestas aliter nunc videre debes, ut frictiones et luctationem...et saltationem. Promitto illa vere esse officia animalis domestici, et in amphitheatro tantum paulum ludebam...et tantum feci quod saltatio posce...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1050
translate latin a1s4_6a20a80d:

    # "I shake my head."
    "Caput quatio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1051
translate latin a1s4_8651ae8d:

    # m "\"I think you've been really good about not taking advantage of me at all. It's fine.\""
    m "\"Puto te optime egisse, quod me nullo modo abusus es. Bene est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1053
translate latin a1s4_bc9de312:

    # "Amicus looks at me, unsure."
    "Amicus me incertus intuetur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1054
translate latin a1s4_3b363865:

    # a "\"And you never have to do those things again if you don't want. I'll understand.\""
    a "\"Et illa numquam rursus facere debes si non vis. Intellegam.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1055
translate latin a1s4_112d764c:

    # "I raise a hand up."
    "Manum tollo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1056
translate latin a1s4_7e1b6365:

    # m "\"Seriously, you're fine.\""
    m "\"Serio dico, nihil mali est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1058
translate latin a1s4_99900ed3:

    # "Amicus looks away, looking relieved but still ashamed."
    "Amicus oculos avertit, relevatus ut videtur, sed adhuc pudore affectus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1059
translate latin a1s4_b33058d4:

    # a "\"I'm sorry it's...it's just something that's followed me most of my life. I had an...incident happen several years back and it's created a lot of rumors about me. The people aren't very interested in having a tail-raiser as their emperor.\""
    a "\"Ignosce, id...id me per maximam vitae meae partem secutum est. Ante aliquot annos mihi quaedam...res accidit, quae multos de me rumores excitavit. Populus non multum cupit imperatorem caudam attollentem habere.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1060
translate latin a1s4_87e6d4a2:

    # "Amicus finally looks at me."
    "Amicus tandem me intuetur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1062
translate latin a1s4_4efa73b0:

    # a "\"So I try to keep it quiet so that it might be forgotten...thought it mostly was until the Khemian mentioned it.\""
    a "\"Ita rem tacere conor ut fortasse oblivioni detur...putabam eam magna ex parte oblitteratam esse, donec Khemianus commemoravit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1063
translate latin a1s4_2df92d67:

    # "Amicus growls."
    "Amicus fremit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1065
translate latin a1s4_59653648:

    # a "\"Anyway, I'm sorry. I suppose it was something I should have told you considering how close quarters we've been living.\""
    a "\"Quidquid est, veniam peto. Credo id aliquid esse quod tibi dicere debebam, cum tam angusto in loco una vivamus.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1066
translate latin a1s4_450ace71:

    # "The wolf looks so dejected, so sad...I decide that I should tell him."
    "Lupus tam abiectus, tam tristis videtur...statuo me ei dicere debere."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1067
translate latin a1s4_51951e2c:

    # m "\"You know, I'm gay too?\""
    m "\"Scisne me quoque viros amare?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1068
translate latin a1s4_dde743ea:

    # "Amicus snaps his gaze back to me, eyes wide."
    "Amicus subito ad me oculos dilatatos refert."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1070
translate latin a1s4_3c8805f7:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"Quid?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1071
translate latin a1s4_85f217b3:

    # "I feel my face turning red."
    "Vultum meum rubescere sentio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1072
translate latin a1s4_2bc0813b:

    # m "\"I'm the same. I like guys.\""
    m "\"Idem sum. Viri mihi placent.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1073
translate latin a1s4_10ac3bf0:

    # "Amicus squints at me, like he can't quite believe what I just said."
    "Amicus contractis oculis me intuetur, quasi vix credere possit quod modo dixi."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1075
translate latin a1s4_f41aecd7:

    # a "\"Are you...making fun of me?\""
    a "\"Me...irridesne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1076
translate latin a1s4_8f19b94e:

    # m "\"What? No! I'm telling you so you don't feel so bad about it. It's fine.\""
    m "\"Quid? Non! Tibi dico ne de hac re tam male sentias. Bene est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1077
translate latin a1s4_69f0220c:

    # a "\"Oh.\""
    a "\"O.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1079
translate latin a1s4_496b2569:

    # a "\"That's quite the coincidence.\""
    a "\"Mirum profecto est nos ita congruere.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1080
translate latin a1s4_bee80475:

    # m "\"Yeah, it is.\""
    m "\"Ita, est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1081
translate latin a1s4_8302c713:

    # a "\"Well, uh, thank you for telling me. That isn't easy to do, at least it isn't for me.\""
    a "\"Bene, em, gratias tibi ago quod mihi dixisti. Id facere facile non est, saltem mihi non est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1082
translate latin a1s4_43d33f0d:

    # m "\"I'm the same.\""
    m "\"Mihi idem est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1083
translate latin a1s4_08028c69:

    # "I slowly walk over and sit on the sofa next to the wolf, feeling strangely awkward about our little coming out conversation."
    "Lente ad lupum ambulo et iuxta eum in lecto sedendi sedeo, mira quadam verecundia affectus de brevi nostro colloquio quo amorem nostrum confessi sumus."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1084
translate latin a1s4_b0a6ad85:

    # "Amicus still looks a bit uncomfortable, but at least he doesn't look sad anymore."
    "Amicus adhuc paulum incommodus videtur, sed saltem iam tristis non videtur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1085
translate latin a1s4_0988c18a:

    # m "\"Soooo, since we're talking about all of this...what was Neferu saying about me...helping you out with your dick. Is that a pet duty too?\""
    m "\"Itaaaque, cum de his omnibus loquamur...quid Neferu dicebat de me...mentulae tuae opem ferente? Estne id quoque animalis domestici officium?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1087
translate latin a1s4_c61f177f:

    # a "\"Well, yes, yes it is. But again, I would never ask that of you.\""
    a "\"Bene, ita, ita est. Sed iterum dico me id a te numquam petiturum esse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1088
translate latin a1s4_db34a898:

    # m "\"Does Alex do that?\""
    m "\"Alexne id facit?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1090
translate latin a1s4_c03a3102:

    # "Amicus pulls a face."
    "Amicus vultum contrahit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1091
translate latin a1s4_89eda736:

    # a "\"While I'd rather not think of my brother in such a situation, yes, he does.\""
    a "\"Quamquam fratrem meum in tali re cogitare nolo, Alex quidem facit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1092
translate latin a1s4_5959d4d5:

    # m "\"But...does that mean your brother's gay too?\""
    m "\"Sed...significatne id fratrem tuum quoque viros amare?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1094
translate latin a1s4_e6dce92e:

    # a "\"No, well, not as far as I know. He doesn't have a preference for males. Isn't that what makes you a homosexual?\""
    a "\"Non, bene, non quantum scio. Mares non praefert. Nonne id est quod aliquem eiusdem sexus amantem facit?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1095
translate latin a1s4_8619f2c6_1:

    # "I shrug."
    "Umeros tollo."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1096
translate latin a1s4_118d18df:

    # m "\"So I'd just...give you a hand-job, or something?\""
    m "\"Ita ego tantum...mentulam tuam manu tractem, aut aliquid tale?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1098
translate latin a1s4_9c22525e:

    # "I can tell that the Lingua had no trouble translating that to Amicus, because he immediately blushes again."
    "Intellegere possum Linguam nullo negotio id Amico vertisse, quod statim rursus rubescit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1099
translate latin a1s4_2940e9ae:

    # "I squirm, wondering why I'm asking so much about this topic."
    "Me agito, mirans cur tot quaestiones de hac re ponam."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1100
translate latin a1s4_14fbb01c:

    # "I'm curious and I already know that I'm attracted to this wolf."
    "Curiosus sum et iam scio hunc lupum me allicere."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1101
translate latin a1s4_816546ad:

    # "I'd given up on denying it a while ago."
    "Iam dudum id negare desieram."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1102
translate latin a1s4_91eafdcf:

    # a "\"It can involve a lot of things...I mean, if you want to do it, I have no objections...but it's your choice!\""
    a "\"Multa complecti potest...hoc volo dicere: si facere vis, nihil obicio...sed tu eligis!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1103
translate latin a1s4_ed75ff4d:

    # "Amicus sounds tentatively hopeful, and I realize that he actually wants it."
    "Ex voce Amici timida quaedam spes auditur, et intellego eum id re vera velle."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1104
translate latin a1s4_921026fb:

    # "It seems that every day I go further and further with this wolf."
    "Videor cotidie cum hoc lupo longius longiusque procedere."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1105
translate latin a1s4_886741dc:

    # "I laugh, partly at Amicus's expression, and partly because of the absurdity of this entire situation."
    "Rideo, partim ob vultum Amici, partim quia haec tota res tam absurda est."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1106
translate latin a1s4_9e6bc8f3:

    # m "\"How about if we win the dance trial...I'll think about it.\""
    m "\"Quid si certamen saltationis vincimus...de eo cogitabo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1107
translate latin a1s4_3c38ecb7:

    # "I'm speaking without thinking."
    "Sine cogitatione loquor."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1108
translate latin a1s4_569bb2f5:

    # "Amicus is quiet, then nods."
    "Amicus tacet, deinde annuit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1110
translate latin a1s4_ea044ba4:

    # a "\"Sounds fair.\""
    a "\"Aequum videtur.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1111
translate latin a1s4_dc7c6ef0:

    # "I try to think of something else to talk about, still shocked at what I'd just proposed."
    "Aliud de quo loquamur excogitare conor, adhuc attonitus ob id quod modo proposui."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1112
translate latin a1s4_09816e00:

    # m "\"So what's the deal with Neferu? Why'd he do all that stuff in the bath?\""
    m "\"Quid igitur cum Neferu est? Cur illa omnia in balneis fecit?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1114
translate latin a1s4_717b1dbd:

    # a "\"I honestly have no idea. It was very strange.\""
    a "\"Vere nullam ideam habeo. Valde mirum erat.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1115
translate latin a1s4_f9c9adf4:

    # m "\"Hmm, do you think that's his way of furthering an alliance?\""
    m "\"Hmm, putasne hoc eius modum esse societatem promovendi?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1117
translate latin a1s4_3f58a604:

    # a "\"Not if he has any common sense. I thought he was going to be friendly considering he knows I'm open to the alliance, unlike Cassius.\""
    a "\"Non si quicquam communis sensus habet. Putabam eum amicum futurum, cum sciat me, aliter ac Cassium, societatem admittere velle.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1118
translate latin a1s4_1bb0b2a0:

    # "I lean back on the sofa, thinking."
    "In lecto sedendi reclino et cogito."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1119
translate latin a1s4_84bccb62:

    # m "\"Hmm, maybe he was just feeling you out.\""
    m "\"Hmm, fortasse te tantum temptabat.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1120
translate latin a1s4_9c5bdf06:

    # "Amicus smirks at that."
    "Amicus hoc audito subridet."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1122
translate latin a1s4_c9bd43c6:

    # a "\"You could say that. Anyway, I don't know how to feel about him. I'm thinking of just telling him that I'm not interested in the alliance unless they send someone that has more tact.\""
    a "\"Ita dicere possis. Quidquid est, nescio quid de eo sentiam. Cogito ei tantum dicere me societatem nolle, nisi aliquem mittant qui prudentius cum hominibus agat.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1123
translate latin a1s4_4ad4d594:

    # "Amicus glances at me."
    "Amicus me breviter intuetur."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1124
translate latin a1s4_615b956e:

    # a "\"What do you think?\""
    a "\"Quid tu censes?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1130
translate latin a1s4_2e90bbe1:

    # m "\"Well...I think if he's the only guy you have to establish the alliance with, you should try to work with him. I mean, this could be your best chance if you're willing to put up with him.\""
    m "\"Bene...puto, si solus est cum quo societatem constituere potes, te cum eo agere conari debere. Hoc volo dicere: haec optima occasio tua esse potest, si eum pati vis.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1132
translate latin a1s4_fea09bf9_1:

    # a "\"Hmmm...\""
    a "\"Hmmm...\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1133
translate latin a1s4_562aceec:

    # m "\"And he seems to have the hots for you, so that'll probably help you, honestly.\""
    m "\"Et te ardenter cupere videtur, ita id, ut verum dicam, probabiliter tibi proderit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1135
translate latin a1s4_0d98fafa:

    # a "\"Heh, maybe.\""
    a "\"Heh, fortasse.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1137
translate latin a1s4_d1834f85:

    # m "\"Honestly, if that's what the Khemians send to foster an alliance, I have to wonder about them as a whole.\""
    m "\"Ut verum dicam, si talem hominem Khemiani ad societatem fovendam mittunt, mihi de omnibus dubitare necesse est.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1138
translate latin a1s4_a4bc53af:

    # a "\"They are an arrogant people, as I've said.\""
    a "\"Gens superba sunt, ut dixi.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1139
translate latin a1s4_cff67bed:

    # m "\"And maybe his intentions aren't all that great if that's how he treats his prospective allies.\""
    m "\"Et fortasse consilia eius non tam bona sunt, si ita cum sociis futuris agit.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1141
translate latin a1s4_e72b5e35:

    # a "\"Agreed.\""
    a "\"Assentior.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1143
translate latin a1s4_c23b90ec:

    # m "\"But I dunno, I'm not a politician.\""
    m "\"Sed nescio; rei publicae peritus non sum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1145
translate latin a1s4_31977895:

    # a "\"But you are smart!\""
    a "\"Sed callidus es!\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1146
translate latin a1s4_1dfc7b4e:

    # m "\"Thanks.\""
    m "\"Gratias.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1148
translate latin a1s4_e1214122:

    # a "\"Anyway, I'm off to my shower.\""
    a "\"Quidquid est, ad lavacrum imbratile eo.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1149
translate latin a1s4_1708ddfd:

    # "The wolf stands up, and I do the same."
    "Lupus surgit, et ego idem facio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1150
translate latin a1s4_fe78655b:

    # m "\"Do you need help?\""
    m "\"Auxilio eges?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1152
translate latin a1s4_c791bb9d:

    # a "\"Oh...really?\""
    a "\"O...vere?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1153
translate latin a1s4_c806ebc0_5:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1154
translate latin a1s4_697e098d:

    # "I want to show him that things haven't changed, that I'm not scared of him now that I know his secret."
    "Ei ostendere volo res non mutatas esse, me eum non timere nunc quod arcanum eius scio."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1155
translate latin a1s4_c26c3c71:

    # "He looked so devastated when he told me."
    "Tam fractus videbatur cum mihi dixit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1156
translate latin a1s4_23a0b7a8:

    # "And even if Amicus was the one to get me into this mess, I know now that he's a good person and doesn't deserve to feel like that."
    "Et quamquam Amicus ipse me in hanc calamitatem duxit, iam scio eum bonum hominem esse nec mereri ut ita sentiat."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1157
translate latin a1s4_48c61ee2:

    # m "\"I mean, I've seen your junk already, so no surprises there, right?\""
    m "\"Hoc volo dicere: iam genitalia tua vidi, ita ibi nihil mirum erit, nonne?\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1159
translate latin a1s4_4f71987f:

    # a "\"Heh, I suppose not...if you're sure.\""
    a "\"Heh, credo non...si certus es.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1160
translate latin a1s4_3d9e81d6:

    # m "\"I'm sure.\""
    m "\"Certus sum.\""

# game/a1s4.rpy:1162
translate latin a1s4_8db7c553:

    # "To decide things for the wolf, I walk into the shower."
    "Ut rem pro lupo decernam, lavacrum imbratile intro."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1163
translate latin a1s4_1f023d98:

    # "Amicus isn't far behind."
    "Amicus haud longe post me venit."

# game/a1s4.rpy:1167
translate latin a1s4_fec97169:

    # "To be continued..."
    "Continuabitur..."

translate latin strings:

    # a1s4.rpy:1126
    old "Talk to him more."
    new "Plus cum eo loqui."

    # a1s4.rpy:1126
    old "Reject him."
    new "Eum reicere."

